<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:49:35 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hêêl Kaxay Mak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mak</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mrk</para>
  <para style="mt">Mak</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Kapa tep Hêêl Kaxay ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Koot Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="MRK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Đaji heq jah valơk đom rahlăp hlit Ê-sai:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Dayh 'yo nee, Gô patăk xapok ku Gô hooy kangưưr mot Koot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">adro hnoq deep trôôk ku Koot;<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />muuyq apok taayh kôt đom wăngq we:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Dayh deep 'miêh trôôk ku Lôôk;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">dơơp dong hyioh kaluh trôôk ku Kadraq.’”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Jăng heq truh, dơơp bap-tem đom wăngq we ji padoh pato pheep bap-tem ku varơuq wiit xuum truh varơuq ka'lăk kadrôôp. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Loch dêh Ju-đê ji tôôy adro aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem garuk truh kung kơy ji oot jah kơy dơơp bap-tem 'laarq daak Jô-đanh tuôôy xưng nhonq kadrôôp maroh oot. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Jăng yôôych hlưp aau bơơn hlôôk laak đa kung hnek katêêk kađuh rawiit katêêk kơy, ji xa lêêp dii daak hluut gôk. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Kơy padoh pato đaneq: “Kơy e taay yaak iaq gô đong truh atêq gô, laa Kơy đơu gô leh xưngq đangq kuu pôôt xôq luh talơy kaxôôp ku Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Gô dơơp bap-tem ka oh ay bơơn daak, bơh Kadraq hnoq dơơp bap-tem ka oh ay bơơn Kơy Phool Hiel.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Varơuq xalih vlôh đom kaluh hngơy nưq, nưq laa Lôôk Jê-xu heq truh xing Na-xa-ret thuôk dêh Ga-li-lê, ji Kadraq jah Jăng dơơp bap-tem 'laarq daak Jô-đanh. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Ji hloay juneq, tuôôy tok klơlh daak, Kadraq hloq kaluh tal plêêk jah luh vlôh ji Kơy Phool Hiel kahri pôôt tol Kadraq đaji xêêp katrơu. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Ji muuyq apok xanoh truh xing plêêk: “Koot laa Koot xung xiaq ku Gô. Gô thier ahyơơl xuum truh Koot.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Hloay juneq, Kơy Phool Hiel ahluk ahlul Kadraq hooy muut wăngq we. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Kadraq măn đom wăngq we poot kưl hngơy, chiuq Sa-tan adô aluut. Kadraq măn dii ôô gôk, ji yaak plêêk hơu varơuq Kadraq.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Atêq tuôôy Jăng biq rôp, Lôôk Jê-xu hooy truh Ga-li-lê đnooy vlôh Hêêl Kaxay ku Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />ji đnooy đaneq: “Kawat heq xaleep, ji daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk heq truh jeq. Dayh wiit xuum ji tuôq aduq Hêêl Kaxay.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Tuôôy hooy angach tyauq gah tahli Ga-li-lê, Kadraq hloq Si-môn ji Anh-rê, oh ku Si-môn, đong dăk lưyq tol tahli, vii oot laa khơl rôp ka. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Dayh hooy tyauq thơy yơu, yôôch thơy hnoq khienq oh ay vlôh jêêk dro hmơt lươyq manih.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Hloay juneq, tuôôy heq ka'lăk lươyq hlê, oot hooy tyauq Kadraq.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Tuôôy hooy athêêp muuyq đoanq đnoyq, Kadraq hloq Ja-kơ, koot kanau Xê-bê-đê, ji Jăng, oh ku kơy, oot đong kaval lươyq tol ge. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Hloay juneq, atêq tuôôy Kadraq taayh oot, yôôych oot dưk hooy tyauq Kadraq, xôq vaq oot laa Xê-bê-đê măn hlê tol ge kung dii toleq dro dơơp hngơy.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Kadraq muut đom theng Ka-bê-na-um, ji hloay juneq, đom hngơy Sa-bat, tuôôy heq hooy muut hnhư tagumq, Kadraq xarôp padoh pato. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Khơl kadrơy tưng hưng truh apok pato ku Kadraq, vii Kadraq heq pato dayq oot đaji e qwuyen da uh nưq leh đaji khơl thơy pato ganuun. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Hloay juneq, muuyq dro biq garu xi nhôp 'miêh đong măn đom hnhư tagumq ku oot, ay nưq pariau tok, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />đaneq: “Kuh Jê-xu Na-xa-ret, 'wot e apiq kajoq truh Kadraq? Jơq be Kadraq truh xôq păk kaxêêt 'wot? Gô xet Kadraq laa kơyq — Kơy Vah ku Kơy Plêêk!” <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Lôôk Jê-xu toah ni, đaneq: “Dayh hnhep yơu ji vlôh klơlh dro neq!” <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Yôôch atêq tuôôy garu xi va gưlh ay nưq pôôt, ji alo kôt apok, yôôych ni vlôh klơlh ay nưq.<verse eid="MRK 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Tôôy adro yôq varaal, pheq đnooy tajauq athêêk dii mamuuyq đaneq: “Varơuq neq laa aleq? Muuyq pato dayq đơơu tyauq qwuyen da uh! Pheq đnooy kơy nưq đnooy dăt ka garu xi ji oot tameng apok kơy nưq.” <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Yôôch hêêl nưq truh Kadraq hloay juneq pahêêr vlôh loch aduq truh dêq dêh gah gih Ga-li-lê.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Hloay juneq, tuôôy chuh klơlh hnhư tagumq, oot muut đom hnhư Si-môn ji Anh-rê, kung dii Ja-kơ ji Jăng. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Tuôôy nưq, miq kadrê ku Si-môn đong biq jiq tanget vik tol chanưng, ji oot vơơ đnooy dii Kadraq truh mo. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Tuôôy truh jeq, rôp xok ti mo, Kadraq rôôk mo kah, ji jiq tanget yơh klơlh mo, yôôch mo xarôp hơu varơuq oot.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Anưq yôôch, truh rayôôp klôôy, atêq tuôôy mot hngơy heq lôp, khơl kadrơy xagook truh ka Kadraq dêq hloay dro leq tavơh bingq ji khơl adro biq kamuuych nhôp. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Kaah theng heq anguk hlê măn ka 'mok. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Kadraq payơh 'ngưng dro biq jiq jiêh dii đu thưq bingq tâk, ji druyh 'ngưng kamuuych, đơu Kadraq leh ăm pheep kaluh kamuuych tok apok vii oot xet Kadraq.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Muut ka xaroq meel, tuôôy dêh măn thier kamơng, atêq tuôôy kadrăch kah, Kadraq vlôh pi gôk, hooy truh muuyq aduq wăngq vleng, ji ka aduq nưq, Kadraq apôôy. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Si-môn ji khơl adro măn dii Kadraq hooy axek Kadraq, <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />ji oot axek hloq Kadraq, yôôych tơơl dii Kadraq đaneq; “Tôôy adro đong akhiim thơy.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Kadraq dăt oot: “Haay dayh hooy aduq kadrơy, đom kaluh theng gah gih, xôq thơy kung padoh pato kađnư đnoyq, vii thơy heq truh laa bơyh varơuq neq.” <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Kadraq hooy truh loch dêq hloay dêh Ga-li-lê, padoh pato đom kaluh hnhư tagumq ku manih karôp ji druyh kamuuych. <verse eid="MRK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Tuôôy nưq, muuyq dro biq jiq paruh truh kung Kadraq, apôôy vôôch Kadraq ji kul pôôt, đnooy dii Kadraq, đaneq: “Atoh thơy trôôch, thơy e qwuyen khienq gô jah xarêh.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Ji vii arơơk xuum biit angơuq, tuôôy tơơk ti kadraq vlôh, Kadraq vêq muut ay, ji đnooy dii ay: “Gô trôôch. Dayh xarêh yơu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Hloay juneq jiq paruh hlơơp klơlh ay ji ay jah xarêh.<verse eid="MRK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Atêq tuôôy găk xarooy đnooy adroyq ka ay, Kadraq hloay juneq ăm ay nưq hooy. <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />Kadraq dăt ay nưq: “Dayh rơơt rol, ay te liq đnooy kajoq dii paq kê dro leq, bơh dayh hooy, kahnoq xăk dii thơy tơơk tưp ji dayh tưp kaluh kuah lêh vii varơuq jah xarêh ku ay, laa varơuq đơu Môi-se heq pato dayq, đaji muuyq apok xanưk ka oot.” <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Lunư, atêq tuôôy hooy klơlh, ay nưq xarôp đnooy vlôh ka 'ngưng dro ji đnooy hêêl neq loch aduq, pheq dơơp Kadraq leh ik muut đom muuyq theng leq trôôk kahnoq xăk ik đnoyq, đơu Kadraq măn pi gôk aduq kaluh aduq wăngq vleng, ji manih karôp xing tôôy aduq măn đong truh dii Kadraq.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Tuôôy wiit muut hlê đom theng Ka-bê-na-um atêq toleq hngơy, manih karôp tameng xet đaneq Kadraq đong măn đom hnhư. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Ji 'ngưng adro heq anguk hlê pheq đnooy paq măn e aduq đnoyq, hloay aduq 'mok muut vlôh kung leh, măn Kadraq pato đaauq ka oot. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Muuyq sôôq adro truh kung Kadraq, xagook tyauq muuyq dro taqwauq talêêt, jah xakôôk bơyh poot dro. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Jo leh ik truh jeq Kadraq vii kơq manih karôp, oot tơq apo đơ klip aduq Kadraq măn, ji atêq tuôôy dơơp vlôh kawah hong, oot raduk pôôt chanưng đơu dro taqwauq talêêt đong vik. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Tuôôy heq hloq xuum tuôq ku oot, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii dro taqwauq talêêt: “Nee koot, kadrôôp maroh koot heq jah ka'lăk!”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Bơh toleq thơy pato ganuun đong 'ngôôy măn đnư biit ravơq đom xuum oot: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Aleq dro neq laay đnooy đanưq? Kơy nưq dik katơơk galơh! Kơyq e qwuyen ka'lăk kadrôôp đêh vlôh muuyq dro Kơy Plêêk?”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Hloay Juneq, vii Lôôk Jê-xu heq xet đom xuum klaak Kadraq đaneq oot đong kadih biit ravơq đanưq, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Aleq êêp kơy laay biit kaluh varơuq nưq đom xuum? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Varơuq leq laa klêq iaq xôq đnooy dii dro taqwauq talêêt, ‘Kadrôôp maroh ay heq jah ka'lăk!’ long đnooy ‘Dayh dưk tok, kabiin chanưng ay tok ji tawaak hooy!’? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Bơh xôq khơl kơy xet đaneq Koot Manih tol vari neq e qwuyen da uh ka'lăk kadrôôp”, Kadraq đnooy dii dro taqwauq talêêt: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Gô dăt ay dayh dưk tok, kabiin chanưng ku ay tok, ji hooy xuq hnhư ay.”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Nưq laa atêq tuôôy dưk tok yôôych vơ hloay kabiin chanưng tok, ay nưq hooy vlôh kangưưr tôôy dro, pheq dơơp dro leq dro nưq raay akêh ji ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk, đnooy đaneq: “Haay koq hmưq hloq varơuq đanưq.”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Kadraq laay hooy vlôh gah tahli, ji dêq bing tamooy truh dii Kadraq, yôôch Kadraq pato dayq oot. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Đong tuôôy hooy dalơh hlê, Kadraq hloq Lê-vi, koot kanau ku A-phê, đong 'ngôôy aduq xok xơu, yôôych Kadraq dăt kơy: “Dayh tyauq thơy!” Atêq tuôôy dưk tok, kơy tyauq Kadraq.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Varơuq xalih vlôh tuôôy Kadraq đong waal xa aduq hnhư kơy, 'ngưng dro xok xơu kung đaji adro e kadrôôp kung 'ngôôy xa dii Lôôk Jê-xu ji khơl xatyauq Kadraq, vii 'ngưng dro kung heq tyauq Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Tuôôy khơl thơy pato ganuun thuôk ja Pha-ri-si hloq đaneq Kadraq 'ngôôy xa dii khơl dro e kadrôôp ji khơl xok xơu, oot đnooy dii khơl xatyauq Kadraq: “Aleq Kơy nưq xa kung dii bing xok xơu ji adro e kadrôôp?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Atêq tuôôy tameng apok nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Manih kalh paraat leh e duh truh thơy jarơơu, bơh laa manih tavơh bingq. Gô leh truh xôq taayh tawooyh manih hyioh jăk, đơu laa adro e kadrôôp.” <verse eid="MRK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Măn Khơl xatyauq ku Jăng ji manih Pha-ri-si đong deek xa, oot kung truh ji vôôch Kadraq: “Vii kakơq kajoq đơu khơl xatyauq ku Jăng ji khơl xatyauq ku manih Pha-ri-si deek xa, bơh khơl xatyauq ku thơy leh deek xa?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Khơl adro jưq lêh pajêêk be ik deek xa đom tuôôy ok đong măn dii oot, jơq be? Tabơh dong leq oot e ok măn dii oot, yôôych oot hnoq leh deek xa ik. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Bơh kaluh hngơy hnoq truh, laa tuôôy đơu ok heq biq xagook hooy klơlh oot, yôôych tuôôy nưq, oot hnoq deek xa đom kaluh hngơy nưq. <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Leh kơyq kaval muuyq apek vaayh đơơu muut poop aau duut, bơh atoh đaji e kơyq dơơp anưq, yôôych dơơp hyaak phon kaval aduq poop aau, aduq vaayh đơơu dii vaayh duut, yôôch hlêêl hyaak măn xơuq iaq vlôh e. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Leh kơyq tađnưk lok đơơu đom bơu kađuh duut, bơh atoh đaji e kơyq dơơp đanưq, lok hnoq dơơp char vadah bơu kađuh, yôôch dêq lok hloay bơu kađuh raay biq hư, tađôôy muut đnư, lok đơơu măn đom bơu kađuh đơơu.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Varơuq xalih vlôh muut hngơy Sa-bat, tuôôy Kadraq hooy dalơh hlê toleq aloq va, khơl xatyauq Kadraq xarôp parach 'môôk va away đom tuôôy hooy trôôk. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Manih Pha-ri-si đnooy kung Kadraq: “'Yo hơ, aleq bing oot dơơp varơuq leh ik dơơp đom hngơy Sa-bat?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Kadraq đnooy oot: “Êêp kơy koq hmưq đok varơuq Đa-vik — vuua ji khơl manih kung hooy dii kơy — heq dơơp tuôôy vuua e kơn duh ji biq pangoot aleq? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Đaleq đơu kơy heq hooy muut hnhư Kơy Plêêk đom đơơy thơy tơơk tưp kôt A-bia-tha, ji xa tôôp tơơk tưp, laa tôôp leh ik pheep xa, đêh vlôh khơl thơy tơơk tưp, ji kơy kung ahlook ka khơl adro đong măn kung dii kơy?”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Hngơy Sa-bat jah dơơp vlôh vii koot manih, nưq leh aalq koot manih vii hngơy Sa-bat. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Vii anưq, Koot Manih laa Lôôk, hloay kaah ku hngơy Sa-bat.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Kadraq laay hooy muut hnhư tagumq, ji muuyq adro e pla ti biq kavăp đong măn aduq nưq. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Khơl kadrơy tyauq tavooy 'yo anhinq 'yo Kadraq , jơq be Kadraq hnoq payơh dro nưq đom hngơy Sa-bat, xôq ka oot hnoq ik rôp kadrôôp Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Kadraq dăt adro e pla ti biq kavăp: “Dayh dưk muut katul.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Ji Kadraq vôôch oot: “Hngơy Sa-bat ik pheep dơơp kaxay long dơơp xơk; wơơt manih long păk kaxêêt manih?” Bơh oot hnhep hloay. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Atêq tuôôy galiah mot 'yo oot dii xuum jaraq, jiq hlu vii varơuq găk xuum ku oot, Kadraq đnooy dii dro khơl kanau: “Dayh hnhong pla ti ku ay vlôh.” Ay hnhong vlôh ji pla ti ay jah yơh hlê. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Ji tuôôy heq vlôh pi gôk, khơl manih Pha-ri-si kung khơl adro thuôk ja Hê-rôt hloay juneq athêêk tajauq xôq vih tachơơl hlê Kadraq, dơơp đaleq xôq bing oot hnoq ik păk kaxêêt Kadraq.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Lôôk Jê-xu kung khơl xatyauq Kadraq wiit xuq pi tahli, ji muuyq bing tamooy thier karôp heq hooy tyauq xing Ga-li-lê, xing Ju-đê, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />xing Jê-ru-sa-lem, ji xing I-đu-mê kung dii dêh pi panưh hơq tavook Jô-đanh, kung đaji rawiit gah theng Ti-rơ ji Si-đôn. Vii tameng xet taleq varơuq Kadraq dưk dơơp, muuyq bing karôp thier 'ngưng heq garuk truh dii Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Kadraq dăt khơl xatyauq kadraq dơơp aleq ka muuyq poop ge de ralauq xôq 'miêh ka Kadraq vii kơq manih karôp, xôq oot leh huq ahnen ahnek Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Bơyh Kadraq heq payơh 'ngưng dro, pheq đnooy long kơyq e bingq tâk pheq ahnen ahnek truh jeq Kadraq xôq hnoq ik vêq muut Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Paq kê tuôôy leq kaluh garu xi hloq Kadraq, kaluh nưq raay kuu xăk pôôt kangưưr Kadraq, ji oot ook tarok, đnooy đaneq: “Kadraq laa Koot Kơy Plêêk.” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Kadraq kajưk apok toah kaluh nưq xôq kaluh nưq leh tauq vlôh truh Kadraq.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Kadraq hooy tok tol đoot ji taayh khơl adro đơu kadih Kadraq trôôch, ji oot truh kung Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Kadraq pato đinq kưl vaarq adro (khơl adro đơu Kadraq kung taayh laa khơl jah rơơlh), xôq oot măn dii Kadraq ji xôq Kadraq hnoq ik patăk dăt oot hooy padoh pato, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />kung đaji kahniq ăm taayh yaak druyh kamuuych. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Kadraq pato đinq kưl vaarq dro: dii Si-môn, Kadraq taayh athêêp anơng laa Phi-e-rơ; <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Ja-kơ, koot kanau Xê-bê-đê, ji Jăng, oh ku Ja-kơ, laa khơl adro Kadraq kung taayh athêêp anơng laa Bô-a-net, iq laa khơl koot kanau ku kơy kata; <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />kung dii Anh-rê, Phi-lip, Ba-thê-lê-mi, Ma-thi-ơ, Thô-ma, Ja-kơ koot kanau A-phê, Tha-đê, Si-môn Xê-lôt, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />ji Ju-đa Ich-ka-ri-ôt, kung laa adro xalih xuum Kadraq.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Kadraq muut đom muuyq poop hnhư, ji bing karôp laay garuk mamuuyq truh, pheq đnooy Kadraq kung khơl jah rơơlh pheq dơơp leh hnoq xa tôôp ik. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Tuôôy khơl adro gah gih Kadraq tameng anưq, oot truh xôq rôp jư Kadraq, vii oot đnooy đaneq: “Ay nưq ta'ngơk yôôch.” <verse eid="MRK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Khơl thơy pato ganuun, laa khơl adro hooy pôôt xing Jê-ru-sa-lem, đnooy đaneq: “Ni biq Bê-ên-xê-bun nhôp,” ji đaneq: “Gamưh lôôk kamuuych đơu ni druyh kamuuych.” <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Bơh tuôôy heq taayh oot truh kung kadraq, Kadraq đnooy dii oot bơơn apok atoh: “Dơơp đaleq Sa-tan hnoq ik druyh Sa-tan? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Atoh muuyq daak dêh biq aklah vlôh kadih tachơơl hlê kadih ni, yôôych daak dêh nưq leh ik dưk kajưk ik. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Atoh muuyq hnhư biq aklah vlôh kadih tachơơl hlê kadih ni, yôôych hnhư nưq hnoq leh ik kajưk xiik ik. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Ji atoh Sa-tan dưk tok tachơơl hlê kadih ni đơu biq ahlook goch, yôôych ni leh ik dưk kajưk, bơh heq truh tuôôy kaxêêt hlơơp. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Đêh dii varơuq kadih tachơơl hlê kadih ni, tuôôy heq muut đom hnhư ku muuyq dro kalh paraat, leh kơyq hnoq ik varoh xok garuh anôôp ku ay nưq đêh vlôh heq vek jah dro kalh paraat nưq adroyq, yôôch atêq nưq đơơu varoh xok hnhư ni. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Dong dik, Gô đnooy êêp kơy, đaneq tôôy kadrôôp maroh ku koot xau koot manih hnoq jah ka'lăk, pheq đnooy paq kê apok katơơk galơh leq oot đnooy vlôh, <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />lunư long kơyq đnooy lôp tachơơl hlê Kơy Phool Hiel, leh e varơuq jah ka'lăk truh đơơy đơơy, bơh adro nưq biq lôp kadrôôp miet miet.” — <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Kadraq đnooy anưq vii oot đnooy: “Adro nưq biq garu xi nhôp.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Miq Kadraq kung khơl oh ku Kadraq truh, ji tuôôy đong dưk pi gôk, oot gamưh adro đnooy ka kadraq, taayh Kadraq vlôh. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Muuyq bing karôp đong 'ngôôy rawiit Kadraq, ji khơl kadrơy đnooy dii Kadraq: “'Yo hơq, miq thơy kung khơl oh ay thơy măn pi gôk, đong axek thơy.” <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Tơơl hlê oot, Kadraq đnooy: “Kơyq laa miq gô ji khơl oh ay gô?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Yôôch atêq tuôôy ralơq mot 'yo khơl adro đong 'ngôôy rawiit gah Kadraq, Kadraq đnooy: “Dayh 'yo nee, miq gô ji khơl oh ay gô! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Vii long kơyq dơơp tyauq iq trôôch Kơy Plêêk, nưq laa ay oh, oh ay, ji miq gô.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Muuyq yưk tra, Kadraq xarôp pato dayq pi gah tahli, ji muuyq bing manih thier karôp tagumq hlê rawiit gah Kadraq. Vii anưq, Kadraq heq tawaak muut muuyq poop ge tol tahli xôq 'ngôôy aduq nưq, măn dêq hloay bing manih măn tol gah tahli. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Kadraq pato oot 'ngưng varơuq bơơn apok atoh, ji đom varơuq pato dayq ku kadraq, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Dayh tameng nee! Hơq, muuyq dro dơơp nôông hooy vlôh paraay adrek. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Varơuq xalih vlôh tuôôy manih paraay adrek, muuyq sôôq kalook klêh gah trôôk ji kaluh xêêp truh xa dêq sôôq nưq. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Sôôq kalook kadrơy klêh tol aduq phơu kalook, laa aduq leh e toleq vari dik, ji ni vlok tok hloay juneq, vii leh chah jaruq muut vari. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Tuôôy mot hngơy vlok tok, ôôlh biq xaar huur vuh, ji vii leh e rayah, kaluh nưq biq ha'yauq kateh. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Sôôq kadrơy klêh muut katul pôôp jaliê, jaliê jalôk vlok tok taqwaat taqwal ni, ji ni leh vlôh raak play kajoq ik. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Kaluh kalook kadrơy đnoyq klêh tol vari kaxay, tưng kalook xagook truh raak play, tuôôy vlok tok yôôch jah kôt tok, ji ni raak play vlôh pe kưl, vlôh drơu kưl, ji vlôh muuyq hreek.” <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Ji Kadraq đnooy: “Kơyq e tôôr xôq tameng, dayh tameng.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Tuôôy Kadraq măn đêh muuyq dro, khơl adro măn rawiit Kadraq kung kưl vaarq dro jah rơơlh vôôch Kadraq truh kaluh apok atoh nưq. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Varơuq kadook truh daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk heq jah kahniq ka oh ay, bơh dii khơl adro kadrơy, tôôy thưq raay laa bơơn apok atoh,<verse eid="MRK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />xôq tuôôy 'yo, yôôych oot măn hnoq ik 'yo, đơu leh hloq ik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">tuôôy tameng, yôôych oot măn hnoq ik tameng, đơu leh hlolh ik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">leh kheoq, oot wiit xuum hlê ji kadrôôp jah ka'lăk ka oot.”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Oh ay leh hlolh apok atoh neq? Anưq yôôych dơơp aleq oh ay hlolh dêq hloay kaluh apok atoh? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Manih paraay kalook nưq paraay đaauq. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Măn neq laa khơl adro pi gah trôôk aduq đơu đaauq jah paraay vlôh, đơu tuôôy oot tameng đaauq nưq, Sa-tan hloay juneq truh ji varoh xok đaauq heq jah paraay aduq oot. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Kung anưq, neq laa khơl adro aduq phơu kalook tuôôy jah paraay, nưq laa adro đơu tuôôy oot tameng đaauq, hloay nhonq xok đaauq dii xuum hlah, <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />đơu oot leh e rayah đom xăk đơu vơ laa đơ đơ. Anưq laa tuôôy pơơl dal long rôp toop xalih vlôh vii kơq đaauq, oot vơ xatôôlh gưlh. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Sôôq kadrơy laa khơl adro katul pôôp jaliê jah paraay đaauq. Nưq laa khơl adro tameng đaauq, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />đơu kaluh varơuq tabông truh đơơy neq ji biit apau ku varơuq karoh e, kung xuum hmưch trôôch 'ngưng varơuq kadrơy xalieh muut, taqwaat hach đaauq ji ni vlôh leh raak play. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Ji neq laa khơl adro tol vari kaxay jah paraay đaauq, nưq laa khơl adro tameng đaauq ji nhonq xok, yôôch vlôh raak tagăp play, vlôh pe kưl, vlôh drơu kưl, ji vlôh muuyq hreek.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Kadraq đnooy ka oot: “Đeen ataak tok leh aalq xôq ik xôq 'laarq wo long 'laarq chanưng jơq be? Be aalq xôq ni ik xôq tol jôôk đeen? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Vii be e varơuq leq laa kadook padu atoh be aalq laa xôq jah tauq vlôh, kung leh e varơuq kajoq heq xalih vlôh trôôk padu kadip đơu leh aalq laa xôq jarooy truh aduq kahnoq vlôh. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Atoh kơyq e tôôr xôq tameng, dayh tameng.” <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yôôch Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Dayh rơơt rol varơuq oh ay tameng. Oh ay hlơk wolh tyauq toleq, yôôych tanưq hnoq jah hlơk wolh ka oh ay ji ni hnoq jah hnook athêêp ka oh ay đnoyq. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Vii adro leq e yôôych ni hnoq jah kahniq ăm adro nưq, măn adro leh e, yôôych pheq đnooy kajoq đơu adro nưq e, hnoq biq xok hooy klơlh ni.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Kadraq taboon: “Daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk laa luneq: dang đaji muuyq adro hơq paraay adrek tol vari, <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />ay nưq vik long parol, klôôy long hngơy, kalook adrek vlok muh ji kôt tok luleq — kadih ay leh xet. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Vari vlôh raak tagăp play tyauq kach ku ni: adroyq dik laa ưk hla, atêq nưq truh 'môôk va, yôôch kalook vôk parêq aduq raak nưq. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Yôôch tuôôy xiêk va dôôp drêêk, ay vơ palo pla lahaay vii xiêk varoot goch heq truh.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Ji Kadraq đnooy: “Haay hnoq ik atoh 'yo daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk đaji luleq, long haay hnoq ik padoh vlôh daak dêh nưq bơơn apok atoh kajoq? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Dang đaji muuyq kalook avơy, laa kalook đơu tuôôy jah paraay pôôt vari, 'miêh laa de dik đom dêq hloay kaluh kalook tol vari, <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />đơu tuôôy heq jah paraay yôôch, ni vlok tok ji vlôh jêêk kôt yơơt iaq tôôy kaluh kaxeq đom hluôôt, ji ni pachah vlôh kaluh đook kôt, pheq đnooy xêêp plêêk hnoq ik dơơp tapu 'laarq yôôp ni.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Dii 'ngưng apok atoh đanưq, Kadraq padoh đaauq ka oot, 'yo tyauq kakơh oot hnoq ik tameng ik, <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />bơh Kadraq be padoh kajoq ka oot đơu leh e apok atoh, lunư tuôôy măn đêh, Kadraq padoh hlolh tôôy varơuq ka khơl xatyauq Kadraq.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Đom hngơy nưq, tuôôy mot hngơy heq wih gach, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Haay duh tapa hlê kơn gah pi hơq.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Ji atêq tuôôy chuh klơlh manih karôp, oot jarooy Kadraq kung hooy dii oot, vii Kadraq 'miêh đong măn tol ge. Kung e kaluh ge kadrơy xatyauq Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Muuyq đơơt khiel kaxuh thier kôt puh tok ji ranaq kưq kapuh muut ge pheq đnooy ge jeq biq viik daak. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Măn kadih Kadraq đong măn pi atêq ge, ganưq angôôlh vik. Oot nhơk kah Kadraq ji tơơl kung Kadraq: “Thơy lơơy, thơy leh biit laa haay jeq kaxêêt aleq?” <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Atêq tuôôy kadrăch kah, Kadraq toah khiel ji xanoh dii tahli: “Dayh hnhep yơu! Dayh ieen hnhep yơu!” Anưq laa, khiel dưk kapuh, ji e varơuq ieen hnhep dêq hloay. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Kadraq đnooy oot: “Aleq oh ay yôq? Oh ay măn koq e xuum tuôq aleq?” <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Oot biq kadrăch varaal dii xuum yôq paal paq ik ji oot đnooy dii mamuuyq: “Anưq yôôych Adro neq laa kơyq, vii pheq đnooy khiel ji tahli pheq tameng apok Kadraq?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yôôch oot hooy truh gah tahli pi hơq, truh dêh vari Jê-ra-sê. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Tuôôy Kadraq vlôh klơlh ge, hloay juneq, muuyq adro biq garu xi nhôp vlôh kôô Kadraq xing kalo xanưng, <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />adro neq e aduq măn đom kaluh kalo xanưng, ji leh kơyq hnoq ik rôp jư ay nưq ik đnoyq, hloay ka xok talơy looy tooy kung leh ik, <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Vii 'ngưng yưk ay biq vek bơơn vawauq ji looy tooy, đơu talơy looy tooy yôôych biq ay parach kloh, măn vawauq yôôych biq tiip naat, ji be kơyq kalh đu xôq rôp jư ay nưq. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Tuôôt kaah hngơy hloay klôôy đom kaluh kôôp xanưng ji tol kaluh aduq ngok đoot, ay nưq alo ook ji choh goch xăk ni bơơn phơu mưr 'mooch. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Tuôôy 'yo hloq Lôôk Jê-xu xing kơn xangưưy, ay charơơk truh ji kuu xăk pôôt kangưưr Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Kôt apok ook alo, ay nưq đnooy: “Kuh Jê-xu, Koot ku Kơy Plêêk Thier Yơơt, gô e apiq kajoq dii Kadraq? Gô apôôy vôôch Kadraq kangưưr paleek Kơy Plêêk, te dơơp ra ơơh gô.” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Vii Kadraq 'miêh heq đnooy ka ni, đaneq: “Garu xi hơq, dayh vlôh klơlh adro neq.” <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Kadraq vôôch ni: “May anơng kajoq?” Ni tơơl kung Kadraq: “Anơng gô laa Kuun Karôp, vii 'wot karôp.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Yôôch ni kưq ratuut apôôy vôôch Kadraq đaneq Kadraq te druyh bing oot vlôh klơlh dêh nưq. <verse eid="MRK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Tuôôy nưq, aduq nưq e muuyq bơy xuur thier 'ngưng đong jah luh xa tol adroay, <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />lunưq oot apôôy vôôch Kadraq, đaneq: “Xiin patăk ka 'wot muut đom bơy xuur, xôq 'wot hnoq ik nhôp muut kaluh nưq.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Kadraq ăm pheep oot, ji tuôôy heq huch vlôh yôôych kaluh garu xi nhôp muut bơy xuur, yôôch bơy xuur — đom kakơh vaarq ravơu poop — xing adroay đoot charuyh charup pôôt tahli ji kaxêêt karăp 'laarq tahli. <verse eid="MRK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Khơl adro jư xuur ka'lăk xadăk ji taboon hlê varơuq nưq đom kaluh theng palơy hloay aduq dêh palơy pla, lunưq 'ngưng adro hooy truh xôq 'yo varơuq kajoq heq xalih vlôh. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Oot truh dii Lôôk Jê-xu ji hloq adro biq kamuuych nhôp — nưq adro hmưq biq kuun karôp kamuuych nhôp muut — đong 'ngôôy đnư, jah xa vâk tơơl dal ji măn đom tuôôy akoq ngook talăng jăk, yôôych oot thier yôq varaal. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Toleq adro dưk xanưk taboon hlê ka oot varơuq heq xalih vlôh đaji luleq ka adro biq kamuuych nhôp ji varơuq truh bơy xuur. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Ji oot đnooy apok apôôy vôôch Kadraq chuh klơlh vari dêh ku ni. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Tuôôy Kadraq đong tawaak muut ge, adro heq hmưq biq kamuuych nhôp ratuut vôôch Kadraq xôq ay hnoq ik măn kung Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Kadraq leh ăm pheep ay, bơh patăk ka ay: “Dayh hooy xuq hnhư ay, truh dii khơl oh ay ku ay đơu taboon hlê ka oot varơuq kôt Lôôk heq dơơp tol ay ji đaleq Kadraq heq kahnoq xuum biit angơuq ay.” <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Ji yôôch, ay vlôh hooy ji xarôp pahêêr đom dêh Đê-ka-bô-lơ varơuq kôt lơyq đaleq đơu Lôôk Jê-xu heq dơơp ka ni, ji kơyq kơyq raay akêh.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Atêq tuôôy Lôôk Jê-xu măn tol ge tapa hlê gah pi hơq yưk tra, muuyq bing manih thier karôp anguk hlê rawiit Kadraq, ji Kadraq đong măn aduq gah tahli. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Hơq, muuyq đom khơl adro jư 'yo hnhư tagumq, anơng laa Jai-ru, hooy truh, ji tuôôy hloq Kadraq, kơy kul pôôt aduq jôôk Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Kơy dêq xuum apôôy vôôch Kadraq tuôôy tơơl đaneq: “Koot kadrê de ku gô đong heq paq ik. Apôôy Kadraq truh xôq Kadraq vêq ti tol xau xôq ka xau hnoq ik jah payơh ji jah riirh.” <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Anưq laa Kadraq hooy dii kơy; muuyq bing manih thier karôp kung hooy tyauq Kadraq ji ahnen ahnek rawiit Kadraq.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />E muuyq khơl drê heq biq be drơy kưl vaarq xanưm, <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />heq chiuq kưk pơơl paq ik bơyh 'ngưng thơy jarơơu ji heq tayuh xarêh tôôy thưq ku ni, đơu be taway hlê ich kajoq, bơh tađôôy muut đnư, bingq măn wih vlôh năngq iaq, <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />atêq tuôôy tameng truh Lôôk Jê-xu, yôôych tuôôy truh jeq pi katoor Kadraq katul bing manih karôp, mư vêq muut aau Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Vii mư biit đaneq: “Atoh gô vơ vêq muut aau Kadraq heq yôôych gô hnoq jah yơh.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Vơ hloay juneq, jiq be drơy ku mư dưk hlê, ji mư tameng xet tol xăk xamơk mư, đaneq xăk xamơk heq jah payơh klơlh bingq. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Hloay juneq, Lôôk Jê-xu, nhonq xet aduq xăk kadraq taay yaak xing kadraq heq vlôh, lunưq wih hlê katul manih karôp, Kadraq vôôch đaneq: “Kơyq heq vêq muut aau ku gô?” <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Khơl xatyauq Kadraq tơơl dii Kadraq: “Thơy hloq manih karôp đong ahnen ahnek thơy, đơu thơy măn vôôch ‘Kơyq vêq muut gô’ ih?” <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Kadraq măn đong 'yo rawiit xôq 'yo kơyq heq dơơp varơuq nưq. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Tuôôy nưq, dro mư kadrê, vii heq vlôh jêêk kamo yôq ji padrau padrik, xet varơuq heq xalih vlôh ka ni, lunưq heq truh, kul xăk pôôt kangưưr Kadraq ji taboon hlê ka Kadraq dêq hloay varơuq dik. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Bơh Kadraq đnooy dii mư: “Nee koot kadrê, xuum tuôq koot heq payơh koot. Dayh hooy đom hrok hrol ji jah yơh kalh klơlh bingq ku koot.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Đom tuôôy Kadraq măn đong đnooy, e toleq adro xing hnhư ku dro dưk xakaq hnhư tagumq truh taboon đaneq: “Koot kadrê ku kơy kaxêêt yôôch. Aleq măn dơơp tawaq Thơy đnoyq?” <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Bơh tuôôy tameng tek apok oot đnooy, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy ka adro xakaq 'yo hnhư tagumq: “Te yôq. Vơ tuôq đơu heq.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Kadraq leh ăm pheep kơyq đêh hooy kung dii Kadraq, đêh vlôh Phi-e-rơ, Ja-kơ ji Jăng, oh Ja-kơ. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Kadraq hooy truh hnhư ku adro xakaq 'yo hnhư tagumq ji hloq ka varơuq diik miik kung nhim ook ji pariau alo tarok 'nhih. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Tuôôy tawaak muut, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Aleq êêp hlu rơu ji nhim ook? Oh de leh kaxêêt, đơu xau đong vik.” <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Anưq laa bing oot xagiel klêêu Kadraq, bơh tuôôy heq pađuôôy dêq bing oot vlôh pi gôk, Kadraq jarooy xatyauq vaq, miq ku oh de ji khơl adro hooy kung Kadraq, yôôch Kadraq truh aduq oh de vik. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Atêq tuôôy rôp ti oh de, Kadraq dăt beq de: “Ta-li-tha, kum!” apok nưq yôôych jah jich laa: “Koot kadrê de, gô dăt koot dayh kah yơu.” <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Hloay juneq, oh de 'ngôôy kah ji tawaak hooy (vii heq jah kưl vaarq xanưm), ji khơl adro măn đnư vơ varaal hwaal, akêh paq ik. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Kadraq kajưk apok đnooy dăt oot đaneq leh muuyq dro leq duh xet varơuq neq, ji Kadraq dăt oot ăm oh de xa.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Xing aduq nưq, Kadraq heq chuh hooy, yôôch xuq truh katu hnhư ku kadraq, ji khơl xatyauq ku Kadraq hooy tyauq Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Truh hngơy Sa-bat, Kadraq xarôp pato dayq đom hnhư tagumq. 'Ngưng manih tameng biq tưng hưng, đnooy đaneq: “Kaluh apok pato dayq neq xok vlôh xing leq? Varơuq khôôt xet heq jah kahniq ka kơy neq kung toleq pheep akêh đaji hơq kahnoq vlôh xing ti kơy nưq laa aleq? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Be aalq neq laa adro thơq môk, koot kanau ku Ma-ri ji ay kanau ku Ja-kơ Jô-sê, Ju-đe ji Si-môn ih? Be aalq toleq dro ma oh kadrê ku kơy nưq đong măn đnen katul haay ih?” Oot biq xatôôlh lôp truh Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot đaneq: “Hnhư hlit yôôych leh thiuq varơuq kul vado, đêh vlôh aduq dêh katu ni, katul khơl takuul takiel ni ji aduq kôôch hnhư ni.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Kadraq leh ik dơơp paq kê varơuq taay yaak leq kađnư, đêh vlôh Kadraq heq payơh bingq tuôôy xôq ti tol thier axit adro jiq jiêh. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Kadraq hloq akêh vii kơq xuum leh tuôq ku oot, yôôch Kadraq hooy pato dayq rawiit kaluh palơy pla.<verse eid="MRK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Kadraq taayh kưl vaarq dro jah rơơlh ji xarôp patăk dăt oot vlôh hooy, vaarq dro vaarq dro, Kadraq kung kahniq ka oot taay yaak tol kaluh garu xi, <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />ji patăk dăt oot đaneq te xagook kajoq tyauq ka tuôôy hooy, đêh vlôh muuyq gay katôôl đơu heq — leh tôôp, leh droong, kung leh baak jêêt đom hnek katêêk — <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />đơu e troaq kaxôôp, ji “Oh ay te hlưp vaarq aau.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Ji Kadraq đnooy ka oot: “Atoh tuôôy oh ay muut đom hnhư leq, dayh kưq măn aduq nưq dong truh tuôôy leq oh ay chuh hooy klơlh hnhư nưq. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Paq kê aduq leq leh đoonq nhonq oh ay, long leh chiuq tameng oh ay, yôôych tuôôy chuh klơlh đnư, dayh tapolh thul 'laarq jôôk haay, đaji bơơn xanưk tachơơl hlê oot.” <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Nưq laa, atêq tuôôy dưk hooy, oot padoh taboon đaneq tôôy adro duh pheq wiit xuum. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Oot druyh 'ngưng kamuuych, kung hloay para dơu ka 'ngưng dro jiq ji payơh oot.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Anưq yôôch, vuua Hê-rôt heq tameng xet hêêl neq, vii yal ahlôôk Kadraq heq wih vlôh ahlôôk ahna, ji khơl kadrơy đnooy đaneq: “Jăng Bap-tit heq jah dơơp ăm riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt, bơyh nưq kaluh pheep akêh taay yaak đong dưk dơơp aduq adro neq.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Măn khơl adro kadrơy đnooy đaneq: “Kơy nưq laa Ê-li.” Đơu sôôq kadrơy đnoyq đnooy nưq laa: “Muuyq hnhư hlit, dang đaji muuyq đom khơl hlit.” <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Bơh tuôôy tameng anưq, Hê-rôt đnooy đaneq: “Jăng, manih đơu gô dool akoq, kơy nưq heq jah khienq ăm riirh hlê.” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Vii kadih Hê-rôt, heq patăk manih, rôp Jăng ji vek kơy đom tu truh varơuq Hê-rô-đia (kadrê ku Phi-lip, ma oh kanau vuua) vii kơq vuua heq pajêêk mo nưq. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Bơyh Jăng heq đnooy dii Hê-rôt đaneq: “Dik laa lôp ganuun tuôôy Vuua pajêêk kadrê ku ma oh kanau vuua.” <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Bơh Hê-rô-đia tôq jaraq kơy ji xung păk kaxêêt kơy, đơu mo nưq leh ik, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />jo Hê-rôt yôq Jăng, vii xet kơy laa adro hyioh jăk ji xuum kaxay, lunưq vuua jư ka kơy jah hrok hrol, long tuôôy tameng kơy đnooy, vuua thier areh xuum, đơu vuua măn e xuum chiuq tameng kơy. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Yôôch tuôôy truh kawat tamuut, laa tuôôy Hê-rôt doot waal hngơy pa iir kơy mơơy khơl padrok dơơp ku kơy kung khơl dưk jarooy bing kuun, ji khơl padrok dêh Ga-li-lê, <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />yôôych tuôôy nưq koot kadrê Hê-rô-đia ku vuua heq tawaak muut, ayuch ayauq, ji khienq Hê-rôt kung khơl adro kung para dii vuua thier hlah xuum, lunưq vuua heq đnooy dii oh kadrê: “Dayh vôôch gô paq kê varơuq kajoq koot trôôch ji gô hnoq ăm ni ka koot.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Kơy paleek dii mư đaneq: “Long koot vôôch gô, truh muut panoot daak dêh ku gô, gô kung hnoq ăm koot.” <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Nưq laa, atêq tuôôy hooy vlôh pi gôk, oh kadrê vôôch miq ni: “Koot duh vôôch kajoq?” Yôôch mo nưq tơơl: “Akoq ku Jăng Bap-tit.” <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Hloay juneq, đom varơuq pơl wol tuôôy wiit muut hlê kung vuua, oh kadrê vôôch: “Koot xung laa hloay juneq vuua ăm ka koot akoq ku Jăng Bap-tit xôq tol garaak.” <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Long vlôh jêêk thier raa hlu rơu, bơh vuua leh trôôch chôôyq ka'lăk oh kadrê bơyh kơq apok paleek ku ni ji khơl manih mơơy đong 'ngôôy kung para dii kơy, <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />lunưq vuua hloay juneq, patăk kuun dool, patăk xagook akoq ku Jăng truh, ji atêq tuôôy vlôh pi gôk, ni hooy dool akoq kơy đom tu. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Ni xagook akoq ku kơy xôq tol garaak ji ăm ni ka oh kadrê, yôôch oh kadrê ăm ni hlê ka miq ni. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Tuôôy heq tameng xet varơuq, khơl xatyauq ku Jăng truh, xok xaak kơy, ji xagook ni hooy up xôq đom xanưng.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Khơl jah rơơlh anguk hlê kung Lôôk Jê-xu, taboon ka Kadraq tôôy varơuq oot heq dơơp ji kaluh varơuq oot heq pato. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Kadraq dăt oot: “Kadih oh ay dayh kadih hooy truh aduq leq nưq đêh raa wăngq vleng, ji dayh padơy vado muuyq jơy.” Vii e thier raa 'ngưng adro hooy dalơh adro hooy hlê, ji oot pheq đnooy leh e kawat xôq xa. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Oot kung mamuuyq hooy tok ge truh muuyq aduq wăngq vleng. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />'Ngưng adro heq hloq oot chuh hooy ji nhonq vlôh oot, lunưq xing loch kaluh theng, khơl kadrơy heq kung mamuuyq charơơk jôôk truh đnư ji truh aduq adroyq oot. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Tuôôy heq tawaak vlôh klơlh ge, Kadraq hloq muuyq bing manih thier karôp, ji Kadraq arơơk xuum biit angơuq oot vii oot dang đaji trưưu leh e manih jư, yôôch Kadraq xarôp pato oot 'ngưng varơuq. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Tuôôy nưq heq ahnuy yôôch, lunưq tuôôy truh kung Kadraq, khơl xatyauq ku Kadraq tơơl đaneq: “Aduq neq laa aduq wăngq vleng ji wat neq heq rayôôp klôôy yôôch. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Vôôch ăm manih karôp vlôh xuq, xôq atêq tuôôy hooy muut kaluh palơy pla gah gih neq, yôôych oot hnoq ik kadih root kajoq nưq xôq xa.” <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Bơh tuôôy tơơl apok oot, Kadraq dăt: “Oh ay dayh ăm oot xa.” Oot tơơl dii Kadraq: “Tuôôy hooy yôôch, e lưp 'wot hnoq ik root jah vaarq hreek đơ-ni-ê tôôp đơu ăm ka manih karôp xa ih?” <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Anưq yôôch, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Dayh hooy. Axek 'yo. Oh ay e toleq poop tôôp?” Atêq tuôôy axek vôôch, oot tơơl: “Dăp poop tôôp ji vaarq poop ka.” <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Kadraq patăk ka dêq hloay manih karôp 'ngôôy pôôt jêêk tưng riak tol rek adriilh. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Oot 'ngôôy aklah vlôh kaluh riak aklah vlôh muuyq hreek dro ji vlôh dăp kưl dro. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Atêq tuôôy adrơk dăp poop tôôp ji vaarq poop ka, 'ngơơk mot tok plêêk, Kadraq kuh kway ji pleelh tôôp vlôh yôôch palo ka khơl xatyauq kadraq xôq oot adrơk ahlook ka manih karôp, Kadraq kung ahlook vaarq poop ka vlôh ka tôôy adro. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Oot raay xa ji jah phiq phơh. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Ji oot tôôch anguk jah kưl vaarq vuk atar viik kaluh paleh tôôp raah ji ka. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Khơl adro heq xa tôôp đom kơh dăp ravơu dro khơl kanau.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Hloay juneq, Kadraq ahluk ahlul khơl xatyauq kadraq tawaak tok ge ji hooy adroyq hlê gah piik hơq, truh Bêt-sai-đa, đom tuôôy Kadraq ăm manih karôp hooy xuq. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Tuôôy oot heq dưk hooy, Kadraq hooy tok đoot xôq apôôy. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Truh klôôy, ge heq măn katul tahli, ji Kadraq măn muuyq dro tol vari. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Hloq oot đong raanq paraat awaayh awơq — vii khiel đong kaxơơlh ngưưr dii oot — yôôych kawah wat poot klôôy nưq, Kadraq hooy jôôk tol raak daak truh aduq oot ji Kadraq xung dalơh hlê oot. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Bơh tuôôy 'yo hloq Kadraq tawaak hooy tol raak daak, oot biit đaneq nưq laa kamuuych, lunưq oot pariau rawôônq tok, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />vii oot raay 'yo hloq Kadraq ji biq varaal hwaal. Bơh hloay juneq, Kadraq đnooy dii oot ji patăk dăt oot: “Dayh kajưk xuum! Laa thơy neq! Te yôq!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Kadraq tawaak muut đom ge dii oot ji khiel langưm hooy hlơơp, khơl xatyauq e varơuq akêh paq ik đom katul khơl oot. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Vii oot heq leh hlolh truh pheep akêh dơơp vlôh tôôp, tađôôy muut đnư, xuum oot măn ja găk gauq.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Tuôôy heq tapa hlê piik gah hơq, oot hooy truh Gê-nê-xa-rêt ji muut gah kađnư. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Tuôôy oot vlôh klơlh ge, vii 'yo xet Kadraq lien, <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />lunưq khơl kadrơy charơơk hooy loch dêh nưq ji xarôp xakôôk khơl adro biq bingq tol chanưng truh aduq đơu oot tameng đaneq Kadraq đong măn đnư. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Long aduq leq Kadraq hooy muut, đom kaluh palơy pla, long đom theng dêh long đom dêh katu, manih karôp raay xagook khơl adro bingq xôq ka aduq tabôôt xa ji vôôch Kadraq xôq axit dik oot hnoq ik vêq muut thơơl aau ku Kadraq, ji paq kê adro leq vêq muut Kadraq raay jah yơh bingq.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Khơl adro Pha-ri-si kung taleq thơy pato ganuun, heq truh xing Jê-ru-sa-lem, đong tagumq hlê rawiit gah Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Vii heq 'yo hloq muuyq sôôq khơl xatyauq ku Kadraq, tuôôy oot xa tôôp dii pla ti klơơr 'yêq, nưq laa koq 'nhaau. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />(Jo manih Pha-ri-si kung đaji dêq hloay manih Jo Thaiq raay leh xa waal atoh koq 'nhaau ti oot rơơt rol, vii tameng jư apok pato hnu ku vaq kơy; <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />ji thưq xagook xing tabôôt xa xuq, oot leh xa atoh koq 'nhaau, ji măn 'ngưng thưq kadrơy đơu oot heq vook xok xôq dơơp tyauq: varơuq 'nhaau dooy dơơt, goq vung, ji kaluh vlong tađnưk bơơn đông.) <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Khơl manih Pha-ri-si ji thơy pato ganuun 'yo vôôch Kadraq: “Vii aleq khơl xatyauq ku thơy leh riirh tyauq apok pato hnu ku vaq kơy, đơu laay xa tôôp bơơn ti koq 'nhaau?” <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Bơh tuôôy tơơl apok oot, Kadraq đnooy đaneq: “Ê-sai đnooy hlit thier jơq truh khơl adro xuum pa ôôh êêp kơy. Đaji e valơk lunưq:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Tamooy neq kul vado gô măn ka vel kapiet</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">bơh xuum klaak ku oot yôôych xangưưy klơlh gô.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Măn oot ayuôôt laat gô đaji hloh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">tuôôy pato dayq kaluh ganuun ku koot manih đaji kaluh ganeen.’<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Dơyh ka'lăk apok tanưưl ku Kơy Plêêk, êêp kơy jư tyauq apok pato hnu ku koot manih.” <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Ji Kadraq đnooy ka oot: “Êêp kơy dik rơơt chôôyq ka'lăk apok tanưưl ku Kơy Plêêk xôq tameng jư apok pato hnu ku êêp! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Vii Môi-se pato: ‘Dayh kul vado vaq haay kung miq haay,’ ji ‘Dro leq axaap vaq long miq, dro nưq pheq chiuq ka varơuq dơơp bơơn varơuq kaxêêt.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Bơh êêp kơy đnooy: ‘Atoh muuyq adro đnooy dii vaq long miq ni: “Long varơuq đơu vaq miq đangq dik jah lo văch xiap xing koot laa Ko-ban (nưq laa kuah lêh tưp Kơy Plêêk),”’ <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />yôôych êêp kơy leh ăm pheep adro nưq dơơp paq kê varơuq kajoq ka vaq long miq ku ni đnoyq, <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />khienq apok ku Kơy Plêêk vlôh jêêk be ik xung liq bơơn apok pato hnu ku êêp kơy đơu êêp kơy heq pato hlê, ji êêp kơy dơơp 'ngưng varơuq dang đanưq.” <verse eid="MRK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Ji atêq tuôôy laay taayh manih karôp truh, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Dêq hloay oh ay dayh tameng gô ji dayh hlolh: <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />be e kajoq xing pi gôk muuyq adro muut đom dro nưq đơu hnoq ik dơơp klơơr 'yêq dro nưq; bơh kaluh varơuq xing pi'lăp vlôh klơlh xăk đơơu laa kaluh varơuq khienq klơơr 'yêq khơl kadrơy.” <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />(Atoh kơyq e tôôr xôq tameng, dayh tameng.)<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Tuôôy Kadraq hooy muut hnhư, xangưưy klơlh bing karôp, khơl xatyauq Kadraq vôôch Kadraq truh apok atoh. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Đanưq đơu oh ay kung leh e varơuq hlolh xet aleq? Oh ay leh nhonq hloq đaneq tôôy thưq xing pi gôk muut đom muuyq adro leh ik dơơp klơơr 'yêq dro nưq ik aleq? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Vii ni leh hooy muut đom xuum manih, đơu laa muut klaak, yôôch biq ka'lăk vlôh đom hnhư kaxoh (iq laa tôôy tuôông xa raay xarêh xaraat.)” <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Bơh Kadraq đnooy đaneq: “Varơuq vlôh klơlh xăk đơơu laa thưq dơơp klơơr 'yêq khơl kadrơy. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Vii măn pi'lăp, vlôh xing xuum klaak koot manih, xanh vlôh kaluh biit xơk, apuq atrăp, atôk varoh, păk kaxêêt manih, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />tuut taak, hmưch kamuk, xơk tauq, pa ôôh aluut, pa rưngq, kalook mot 'yarơ, karoay axaap, tơơk galơh, tavơ xơ. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Tôôy varơuq xơk neq xing pi'lăp đơu vlôh ji oot dơơp klơơr 'yêq khơl kadrơy.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yôôch tuôôy heq dưk tok klơlh đnư, Kadraq hooy truh dêh Ti-rơ ji Si-đôn, ji tuôôy heq muut đom muuyq kôôch hnhư, Kadraq leh trôôch kơyq xet, đơu leh ik padu xăk ik. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Bơh hloay juneq, muuyq khơl kadrê hơq, laa adro e koot kadrê de ku mư biq garu xi nhôp, vii heq tameng truh Kadraq, lunưq tuôôy truh, mư kul xăk pôôt aduq jôôk Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Tuôôy nưq, khơl kadrê nưq laa manih Hi Lap, ưk Si-rô-phê-ni-xi, ji mư apôôy vôôch Kadraq xôq Kadraq druyh kamuuych vlôh klơlh koot kadrê ni. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Kadraq đnooy dii mư: “Adroyq dik, pheq xôq koot xau jah xa dong phiq hămq, vii dik laa leh xaay tuôôy xok tôôp ku koot xau ji avih ka xo koot.” <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Bơh mư tơơl hlê ji tơơl kung Kadraq: “Jơq anưq, kuh Lôôk, ji toleq xo koot măn pi 'laarq para xa xing kaluh kapleh tôôp ku koot xau.” <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Nưq laa Kadraq dăt mư: “Vii apok neq, mư dayh xuq yơu. Kamuuych heq vlôh klơlh koot kadrê ku mư.” <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Tuôôy hooy xuq truh hnhư ni, mư hloq oh de vik tol chanưng, ji kamuuych heq vlôh klơlh.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Ji muuyq yưk tra, atêq tuôôy chuh klơlh dêh Ti-rơ, Kadraq hooy dalơh hlê theng Si-đôn truh tahli Ga-li-lê, truh katul dêh Đê-ka-bô-lơ. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Khơl kadrơy xagook truh ka Kadraq muuyq dro klơk ji valol, yôôch oot apôôy vôôch Kadraq, xôq ka Kadraq xôq ti tol ay nưq. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Tuôôy heq kadih ni xagook dro nưq vlôh klơlh bing karôp, Kadraq xôq kaluh lôk ti kadraq muut vaarq troop tôôr ay, ji tuôôy kaxôh daak dieu yôôch, Kadraq para muut kapiet ay. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Ji 'ngơơk mot tok plêêk, Kadraq khơơh yơơt, yôôch đnooy dii ay: “Ep-pha-ta,” (iq laa: “Dayh luh vlôh!”). <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Anưq laa tôôr ay nưq jah luh vlôh, pơơl hwơơl aduq kapiet ay jah tơq dơyh, ji ay xarôp đnooy ro raang. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Kadraq kơmq oot xôq oot leh đnooy dii kơyq. Bơh Kadraq kơn kơmq oot toleq, oot laay kơn taboon hêêl nưq vlôh 'ngưng iaq tanưq. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Khơl kadrơy thier raa akêh, đnooy đaneq: “Kơy nưq heq dơơp tôôy varơuq dik tolh hloay. Pheq đnooy, kơy nưq khienq ka adro klơk tameng ik ji adro hôp đnooy ik.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Đom kaluh hngơy nưq, laay e muuyq bing manih thier karôp, ji be e kajoq xôq xa, atêq tuôôy taayh khơl xatyauq kadraq, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Thơy biit angơuq bing manih karôp neq, vii oot kưq măn dii thơy heq pe hngơy yôôch đơu koq lưp e kajoq xôq xa dêq. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Atoh thơy patăk ka oot hooy xuq hnhư oot dii klaak pangoot, yôôych oot hnoq phoch langoch tol trôôk, đơu muuyq sôôq adro đom oot heq truh xing aduq thier xangưưy.” <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Khơl xatyauq Kadraq tơơl kung kadraq đaneq: “Adro leq aduq neq, măn aduq wăngq vleng neq, hnoq ik xok xing leq đơu ăm bing karôp đaji neq xa tôôp hưh?” <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Kadraq vôôch oot: “Oh ay e toleq tôôp?” Oot tơơl: “Pơh poop.” <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Kadraq patăk ka manih karôp 'ngôôy pôôt vari, ji atêq tuôôy xok pơh poop tôôp, kuh kway, Kadraq pleh vlôh yôôch palo ka khơl xatyauq kadraq xôq oot hnoq ik xagook waak dơơp, anưq laa oot adoot vlôh ka manih karôp. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Ji oot e toleq poop kaa de, lunưq atêq tuôôy kuh kway truh oot, Kadraq dăt oot kung ahlook phon kaa neq đnoyq. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Manih karôp xa ji jah phiq phơh, yôôch oot anguk jah pơh đêêk tôôp tapleh măn rah. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Tuôôy nưq, e lakah poot ravơu manih, yôôch Kadraq ăm oot xuq. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Hloay juneq, atêq tuôôy muut đom ge kung khơl xatyauq kadraq, Kadraq hooy truh dêh Đa-ma-nu-tha.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Khơl adro Pha-ri-si truh đnư ji xarôp tagêh tajauq dii Kadraq, vôôch axek aduq Kadraq, muuyq dơuq akêh xing plêêk, xôq thưh Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Atêq tuôôy khơơh yơơt đom xuum klaak kadraq, Kadraq tơơl: “Vii aleq adrơơk neq vôôch axek dơuq akêh? Dong dik, Gô đnooy dii êêp kơy, be e dơuq akêh leq hnoq jah kahniq ka adrơơk neq … ” <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Yôôch tuôôy heq chuh ka'lăk oot, muut hlê đom ge, Kadraq hooy hlê gah piik hơq.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Khơl xatyauq tawol xagook tyauq tôôp, ji oot be e kajoq dii oot đom ge, đêh vlôh muuyq poop tôôp. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Kadraq đnooy adroyq ka oot đaneq: “Dayh rơơt rol! Dayh văch 'yo truh tape ku manih Pha-ri-si ji tape ku Hê-rôt.” <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Oot tajauq kung mamuuyq đaneq varơuq neq laa vii oot leh e tôôp. <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Vii xet đanưq, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Aleq oh ay laay tajauq tayaat vii varơuq oh ay leh e tôôp? Oh ay koq lưp xet ik, ji kung koq lưp hlolh ih? E jơq xuum oh ay heq vlôh găk khăk yôôch? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />E mot đơu oh ay leh hloq aleq? E tôôr đơu oh ay leh tameng aleq? Oh ay kung be văch aleq? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Tuôôy thơy pleh dăp poop tôôp ka dăp ravơu manih, oh ay heq anguk jah toleq đêêk atar viik tôôp tapleh?” Oot tơơl kung Kadraq: “Kưl vaarq đêêk atar.” <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“Măn tuôôy pơh poop tôôp ka poot ravơu manih, oh ay anguk jah toleq đêêk atar viik tôôp tapleh?” Oot tơơl dii kadraq: “Pơh đêêk atar.” <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Ji Kadraq đnooy ka oot: “Dơơp luleq đơu oh ay măn koq hlolh?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Oot hooy truh Bêt-sai-đa, ji khơl kadrơy xagook truh ka Kadraq muuyq adro apul, yôôch oot apôôy vôôch Kadraq xôq Kadraq hnoq ik vêq muut ay nưq. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Rôp ti dro apul, Kadraq jarooy ay nưq vlôh pi gôk palơy. Atêq tuôôy kaxôh daak dieu tol mot ay, xôq ti kadraq tol ay, Kadraq vôôch ay: “Ay e hloq dêq hloay thưq kajoq be?” <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />'Ngơơk 'yo tok, ay tơơl: “Gô hloq khơl kadrơy đơu oot 'yo dang kaluh ưk gay đong hooy.” <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Atêq nưq, muuyq yưk tra, Kadraq xôq ti tol mot ay, yôôch ay nưq 'yo anhinq, mot jah yơh hlê ji ay 'yo hloq tôôy thưq kach ro raang. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Kadraq dăt ay hooy xuq hnhư ni, pato dăt: “Te duh muut đom palơy.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Lôôk Jê-xu kung khơl xatyauq kadraq hooy muut kaluh palơy pla thuôk Sê-sa-rê Phi-lip, ji tol trôôk hooy, Kadraq vôôch khơl xatyauq kadraq đnooy dii oot đaneq: “Khơl kadrơy đnooy thơy laa kơyq?” <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Yôôch oot đnooy dii Kadraq, tơơl đaneq: “Jăng Bap-tit, sôôq kadrơy laa ‘Ê-li,’ măn sôôq đêh đnoyq laa: ‘Muuyq đom khơl hnhư hlit.’” <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Kadraq vôôch oot: “Măn oh ay đnooy thơy laa kơyq?” Yôôch tuôôy tơơl apok, Phi-e-rơ tơơl kung Kadraq: “Thơy laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh.” <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Kadraq đnooy adroyq ka oot đaneq oot leh duh đnooy dii kơyq truh Kadraq.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Ji Kadraq xarôp pato oot đaneq Koot Manih pheq chiuq 'ngưng varơuq jiq jiêh, biq ka'lăk vlôh bơyh khơl draq lơơk, khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt kung khơl thơy pato ganuun, ji biq păk kaxêêt, yôôch riirh hlê atêq pe hngơy. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Kadraq heq đnooy apok neq kach ro raang. Phi-e-rơ, atêq tuôôy jarooy Kadraq đêh vlôh, xarôp trek kưq Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Bơh, tuôôy heq wih hlê 'yo khơl xatyauq kadraq, Kadraq toah Phi-e-rơ đaneq: “Sa-tan hơq, dayh chuh vlôh pi têq gô! Vii ay leh xôq xuum ay biit truh varơuq ku Kơy Plêêk, đơu vơ truh varơuq koot manih.” <verse eid="MRK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Atêq tuôôy taayh bing karôp kung khơl xatyauq kadraq, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Atoh kơyq trôôch tyauq atêq gô, dro nưq pheq chôôyq ka'lăk xăk xamơk, hlôôy gay charăk ni ji tyauq gô. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Vii long kơyq trôôch wơơt xăk riirh ni, yôôych hnoq dơơp hlơơp ni, măn dro leq vii kơq gô ji Hêêl Kaxay hnoq chiuq hlơơp xăk riirh ni, yôôych hnoq wơơt jah ni. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Vii ich lơơy kajoq ka adro jah dêq dêh araak đơu laay hlơơp phool hiel ni? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Dro nưq hnoq ik xok kajoq đaji tuôông tađôôy hlê dii phool hiel ni? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Atoh kơyq kamưưl truh gô ji apok ku gô đom adrơơk apuq atrăp ji kadrôôp maroh neq, yôôych Koot Manih kung hnoq kamưưl truh adro nưq tuôôy Kadraq truh đom tađnah tađnaak ku Vaq Kadraq kung dii khơl kơy yaak vah.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Dong dik, Thơy đnooy dii oh ay đaneq e muuyq sôôq dro đong dưk đnen laa khơl adro kajưk dik leh hmưq xet varơuq kaxêêt adroyq tuôôy oot 'yo hloq daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk truh dii taay yaak.” <verse eid="MRK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Drơu hngơy atêq, Lôôk Jê-xu xagook Phi-e-rơ, Ja-kơ ji Jăng yôôch jarooy đêh pe dro oot hooy tok muuyq ngok đoot yơơt, ji Kadraq jah rama xăk kangưưr oot. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Aau Kadraq vlôh jêêk thier raa xaraar tađnah, ko ploat, pheq đnooy leh muuyq dro thơq goch leq tol dêh araak hnoq ik dơơp ăm ko ik đanưq. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Ê-li kung Môi-se jah oot 'yo hloq, ji vaarq kơy nưq đong athêêk dii Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Tuôôy luh apok, Phi-e-rơ tơơl dii Lôôk Jê-xu: “Ra-bi, dik laa tolh ka haay măn đnen, 'wot hnoq ik panưk pe poop raap, muuyq ka thơy, muuyq ka Môi-se ji muuyq ka Ê-li.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />(Vii kơy leh xet kơy duh luh apok đnooy kajoq, vii oot raay varaal yôq.) <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Yôôch muuyq đum kluk pơl truh klum katuh oot, ji apok xanoh ahna vlôh xing đum kluk: “Neq laa Koot xung xiaq ku Gô. Dayh tameng apok Koot nưq.” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Tưng hưng, tuôôy 'yo gah gih, oot paq măn hloq paq e kơyq đêh măn dii oot, đêh vlôh muuyq dro Lôôk Jê-xu.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Tuôôy oot hooy xing tol đoot pôôt, Kadraq dăt oot đaneq oot teliq taboon hlê dii kơyq truh kaluh kajoq oot heq hloq, atoh koq lưp truh kawat Koot Manih xing aduq kaxêêt riirh hlê. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Oot jư kinq apok nưq đom khơl oot, tajauq dii mamuuyq 'yo “xing aduq kaxêêt riirh hlê” laa đaleq. <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Oot koq hlolh dii Kadraq, tơơl đaneq: “Aleq khơl thơy pato ganuun đnooy laa Ê-li pheq truh adroyq?” <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yôôch Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Ê-li jơq laa truh adroyq xôq ralauq hlê tôôy varơuq. Anưq yôôych apok jah valơk truh Koot Manih đaneq Kadraq pheq chiuq 'ngưng varơuq jiq jiêh ji biq 'yo leh ra kajoq laa luleq? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Lunư, thơy đnooy dii oh ay đaneq Ê-li heq truh dik yôôch, ji khơl drơy heq dơơp xet toleq varơuq oot trôôch dii kơy, dang đaji apok heq jah valơk truh kơy.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Tuôôy truh aduq khơl xatyauq măn hlê, oot hloq muuyq bing manih thier karôp rawiit gah oot ji khơl thơy pato ganuun đong tagêh apok dii khơl xatyauq nưq. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Hloay juneq, tuôôy heq hloq Kadraq, dêq bing manih tưng hưng, ji atêq tuôôy charơơk truh kung Kadraq oot vôôch hrok Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Kadraq vôôch khơl xatyauq: “Oh ay đong tagêh dii oot truh varơuq kajoq?” <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Muuyq dro đom bing karôp tơơl apok Kadraq: “Kuh thơy, gô xagook truh ka thơy dro koot kanau ku gô, biq muuyq garu xi hôp nhôp muut. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Long aduq leq ni hnoq ik klooyq hlê koot gô, yôôych ni jăk amik dro ôn pôôt, yôôch ôn vlôh daak kamuh huuy, takik kaneeng, ji găk gauq, gô heq vôôch khơl xatyauq thơy xôq oot druyh vlôh ni, đơu oot leh đu kalh.” <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy tơơl hlê oot đaneq, Kadraq đnooy: “Adrơơk leh tuôq hơq, gô hnoq măn dii êêp dong truh dong leq? Gô hnoq chiuq uunq êêp dong truh dong leq? Dayh xagook oh de truh ka gô.” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Oot xagook oh de truh ka Kadraq, ji tuôôy hloq Kadraq, garu xi hloay juneq khienq ôn tok kơn kojưk, yôôch tuôôy gưlh pôôt vari, ôn vik valien, vlôh kamuh huuy. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Kadraq vôôch vaq ku ôn: “Heq toleq yưk xing tuôôy varơuq neq xalih vlôh dii ôn?” Kơy tơơl: “Xing tuôôy măn de. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Ni kưq 'ngưng qwel ôn, tuôôy yôôych muut ôôlh, tuôôy yôôych pôôt daak, xôq păk kaxêêt ôn, bơh atoh Thơy hnoq ik dơơp kajoq, vii biit angơuq 'wot, xiin thơy waak 'wot.” <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Tuôôy nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii kơy: “‘Atoh thơy hnoq ik’ ư? Tôôy varơuq laa hnoq ik đôôyq dii adro tuôq.” <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Hloay juneq, atêq tuôôy alo tok, vaq ku ôn tơơl: “Gô tuôq! Xiin thơy wơơt rơy tuôôy be tuôq ku gô!” <verse eid="MRK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yôôch tuôôy hloq bing karôp đong charơơk truh aduq oot, Lôôk Jê-xu toah garu xi, patăk ka ni: “Garu xi hôp ji klơk hơq, gô patăk dăt ka may pheq vlôh klơlh oh de ji paq ik nhôp muut ni đnoyq.” <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Atêq tuôôy laa kôt ji dơơp ka oh de kojưk rađiik miik, ni huch vlôh klơlh ji oh de vlôh jêêk dang đaji adro kaxêêt, pheq đnooy 'ngưng dro đnooy đaneq: “Oh de kaxêêt yôôch.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Bơh tuôôy rôp xok ti ôn, Lôôk Jê-xu rôôk ôn kah, ji ôn dưk tok. <verse eid="MRK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Atêq tuôôy Kadraq heq hooy muut hnhư yôôch, khơl xatyauq Kadraq vôôch đêh Kadraq đaneq: “Aleq 'wot leh ik druyh vlôh ik kamuuych nưq?” <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Kadraq tơơl kung oot: “Kaluh kamuuych neq, be kơyq hnoq ik druyh ik atoh leh vii varơuq apôôy ji varơuq deek xa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Ji xing aduq nưq chuh hooy, oot dalơh hlê dêh Ga-li-lê, đơu Kadraq leh trôôch xôq kơyq xet, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />vii Kadraq đong pato dayq khơl xatyauq kadraq, ji đnooy kung oot đaneq: “Koot Manih jeq biq nôôp muut ti khơl kadrơy, oot hnoq păk kaxêêt Kadraq. Tuôôy heq biq păk kaxêêt, Kadraq hnoq riirh hlê atêq pe hngơy.” <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Bơh oot leh hlolh apok neq, ji yôq pheq vôôch Kadraq.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Oot hooy truh theng Ka-bê-na-um, ji tuôôy heq muut đom hnhư, Kadraq vôôch oot: “Oh ay 'miêh tajauq athêêk varơuq kajoq tol trôôk hooy?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Bơh oot hnhep, vii oot heq tagêh apok dii mamuuyq tol trôôk hooy 'yo kơyq laa kôt dik. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Ji atêq tuôôy 'ngôôy pôôt, Kadraq taayh kưl vaarq dro jah rơơlh anguk hlê ji đnooy dii oot: “Atoh kơyq xung dơơp akoq, adro nưq pheq laa adro lôôch đom dêq hloay ji laa xapok ka tôôy dro.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Rơơlh xok muuyq oh de, Kadraq xôq beq de măn katul oot, yôôch atêq tuôôy khwuôt oh de tol ti, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Adro leq taayh yal thơy tiip muuyq đom khơl oh de đaji luneq yôôych dro nưq tiip thơy, ji long kơyq tiip thơy yôôych dro nưq leh vơ tiip thơy, đơu măn tiip Kơy patăk dăt thơy.” <verse eid="MRK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Jăng đnooy dii Kadraq: “Kuh thơy, 'wot heq hloq muuyq dro nưq taayh yal Thơy druyh kamuuych ji 'wot heq klơl dro nưq hlê, vii dro nưq leh tyauq haay.” <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Bơh Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl: “Te klơl adro nưq, vii leh e kơyq laa adro taayh yal thơy dơơp pheep akêh yôôch hnoq ik ka atêq nưq karoay axaap thơy. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Bơyh kơyq leh aalq laa tachơơl dii haay nưq laa muuyq trôôk dii haay. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Vii adro leq taayh yal thơy ăm oh ay muuyq cheet daak vii oh ay thuôk xuq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, dong dik thơy đnooy dii oh ay đaneq adro nưq kajưk dik leh hlơơp phon kadrool ni. <verse eid="MRK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Măn dro leq dơơp xatôôlh lôp ka muuyq đom khơl dro de neq laa khơl dro tuôq gamưh aduq thơy, yôôych be tơơl iaq đôôyq dii dro nưq, varơuq tolh iaq laa ni biq vek muuyq apal phơu kôt rawiit ranong ni, yôôch biq qweek pôôt tahli. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Atoh pla ti oh ay hnoq ik dơơp ka oh ay xatôôlh lôp, dayh dool ni ka'lăk. Varơuq tolh iaq ka oh ay laa dii jiq tâk đơu muut aduq varơuq riirh, măn iaq laa e vaarq pla ti đơu pheq hooy muut ôôlh karuk, đom ôôlh be hmưq poch <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />(duq xadrôk oot leh kaxêêt, ji ôôlh leh biq apoch). <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Atoh pla jôôk oh ay hnoq ik dơơp ka oh ay xatôôlh lôp, dayh dool ni ka'lăk. Varơuq tolh iaq ka oh ay laa dii jôôk atul đơu muut đom aduq varơuq riirh, măn iaq laa e vaarq jôôk đơu biq qweek muut ôôlh karuk <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />(aduq xadrôk oot leh kaxêêt, ji ôôlh leh biq apoch). <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Atoh mot oh ay hnoq ik dơơp ka oh ay xatôôlh lôp, dayh galek ni vlôh. Varơuq tolh iaq ka oh ay laa dii muuyq mot đơu muut đom daak plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk, măn iaq laa e vaarq mot đơu biq qweek muut ôôlh karuk, <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />aduq xadrôk oot leh kaxêêt ji ôôlh leh biq apoch. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Vii tôôy adro hnoq biq ưm voh bơơn ôôlh. <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Voh laa tolh kaxay, bơh atoh voh wih vlôh hlơơp phaak, oh ay hnoq panhưưm muut ni dii bôôt nhưưm kajoq? Oh ay pheq e voh đom xăk, ji riirh tagu dii mamuuyq.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Atêq tuôôy dưk tok, Kadraq hooy xing aduq nưq truh dêh Ju-đê ji dêh vari pi hơq daak Jô-đanh, yôôch manih karôp garuk mamuuyq truh dii Kadraq yưk tra. Kadraq laay pato dayq oot đaji Kadraq măn ragơy dơơp. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Tuôôy khơl adro Pha-ri-si truh jeq, oot vôôch Kadraq đaneq ganuun e ăm pheep muuyq adro kanau ka'lăk kadrê long be, xôq thưh Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Bơh, xôq tơơl hlê, Kadraq đnooy dii oot đaneq: “Môi-se heq pato dayq êêp kơy varơuq kajoq?” <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Oot đnooy: “Môi-se ăm pheep adro kanau valơk hla jơyq ka'lăk kadrê yôôch xôq kadrê vlôh hooy.” <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Bơh Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Vii varơuq găk xuum ku êêp kơy, kơy đơơu valơk vlôh varơuq ganuun nưq ka êêp kơy. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Mot kadrơy, xing tuôôy kapa tep ku varơuq panưk pajêêk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 10:6">‘Kadraq heq panưk jêêk oot, muuyq kanau ji muuyq kadrê.’<verse eid="MRK 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />‘Vii kơq nưq, adro khơl kanau hnoq vlôh klơlh miq ji vaq ni,<verse eid="MRK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />ji vaarq dro hnoq jah jêêk muuyq hlek.’</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 10:8" />
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 10:8">Lunưq, baarq leh măn laa vaarq đơu laa muuyq hlek. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Kơq nưq, varơuq kajoq đơu Kơy Plêêk heq takhiit hlê, yôôych koot manih te aklah vlôh.” <verse eid="MRK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Tuôôy măn đom hnhư, khơl xatyauq laay vôôch Kadraq truh varơuq neq. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Adro leq ka'lăk kadrê ni ji pajêêk muuyq adro kadrơy, yôôych adro nưq lôp kadrôôp tuut taak đôôyq dii adro kadrê. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Ji atoh adro khơl drê, tuôôy heq ka'lăk kanau ni, xok adro kadrơy, yôôych mư lôp kadrôôp tuut taak.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Khơl kadrơy xagook truh ka Kadraq khơl oh de xôq Kadraq hnoq ik xôq ti tol oot, bơh khơl xatyauq đnooy toah oot. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Lunư, tuôôy nhonq hloq varơuq nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu jaraq ji đnooy dii oot: “Dayh xôq khơl on oh truh dii thơy, ji te klơl đơ oot, vii daak plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk thuôk xuq khơl leq dang đaji oot. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Dong dik, thơy đnooy dii oh ay, dro leq leh tiip nhonq daak plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk đaji muuyq on oh, yôôych ado nưq kajưk dik leh jah muut đom nưq.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Atêq tuôôy khwuôt khơl oh de đom ti kadraq, xôq ti tol oot, Kadraq kahniq vanong.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Tuôôy Kadraq xarôp dưk hooy, muuyq dro hơq charơơk truh, ji atêq tuôôy kul pôôt kangưưr Kadraq, adro nưq vôôch Kadraq: “Kuh Thơy Xuum Kaxay, gô duh dơơp kajoq xôq gô hnoq ik jah varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy?” <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Bơh Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii ay: “Aleq ay taayh gô laa xuum kaxay? Be kơyq xuum kaxay đêh vlôh muuyq dro Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Ay heq xet kaluh ganeen: ‘Te păk kaxêêt manih, te tuut taak, te atôk, te dơơp xanưk pa ôôh, te hlơk aluut, pheq 'yo vado vaq ji miq haay.’” <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Bơh ay nưq đnooy kung Kadraq: “Kuh thơy, gô heq tameng jư tôôy varơuq nưq xing tuôôy măn de ku gô.” <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Bơh tuôôy 'yo ay, Lôôk Jê-xu xung xiaq ay, ji Kadraq đnooy ay: “Ay măn thiuq muuyq varơuq; dayh hooy, tek dêq tôôy thưq ay e, ahlook ăm manih adrah, yôôych ay hnoq e kho bauq măn tol plêêk, ji truh đnen ne, dayh tyauq gô.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Bơh mamưưt mot vlôh jêêk hlu rơu adroyq apok nưq, ay nưq jiq xuum ka'lăk hooy, vii ay 'miêh đong e 'ngưng garuh anôôp dik.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Atêq tuôôy 'yo rawiit gah, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii khơl xatyauq kadraq: “Dik pơơl xet toleq đôôyq dii khơl adro e 'ngưng garuh anôôp xôq ik muut đom daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk!” <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Khơl xatyauq thier akêh truh kaluh apok ku Kadraq, bơh muuyq yưk tra, tuôôy tơơl apok, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot đaneq: “Khơl koot lơơy, dik laa pơơl xet dang leq xôq muut đom daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Đôôyq dii ôô laak đa chun hlê troop jarưp, nưq laa varơuq klêq iaq so dii adro karoh muut đom daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk.” <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Yôôch oot thier raa tưng hưng, đnooy dii Kadraq: “Anưq yôôych kơyq hnoq ik jah wơơt?” <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />'Yo muut oot, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Varơuq dơơp leh ik dii koot manih, bơh be aalq dii Kơy Plêêk. Vii dii Kơy Plêêk, tôôy varơuq raay hnoq ik.” <verse eid="MRK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Phi-e-rơ tok apok tơơl dii Kadraq: “Thơy 'yo nee, 'wot heq ka'lăk tôôy thưq đơu tyauq thơy.” <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl: “Dong dik, thơy đnooy dii oh ay, be e adro leq ka'lăk hnhư wah, ay oh, oh ay, vaq miq, koot xau, vari hluôôt vii kơq thơy ji Hêêl Kaxay, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />đơu leh nhonq jah gôôp hreek yưk juneq đom tuôôy đơơy neq: truh hnhư wah, ay oh, oh ay, miq, koot, vari ruôngq kung dii varơuq rôp toop, ji varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy đom tuôôy đơơy têq neq. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Bơh 'ngưng dro adroyq hnoq jêêk vlôh atêq, ji adro atêq hnoq tok adroyq.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Tuôôy nưq, oot đong tol trôôk hooy tok truh Jê-ru-sa-lem, ji Lôôk Jê-xu đong hooy adroyq oot. Oot biq akêh, măn khơl adro hooy tyauq atêq yôôych yôq varaal. Atêq tuôôy jarooy kưl vaarq dro jah rơơlh đêh vlôh, Kadraq laay xarôp đnooy dii oot truh kaluh varơuq jeq xalih truh ka Kadraq, <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />đaneq: “'Yo nee, haay đong hooy tok truh Jê-ru-sa-lem, ji Koot Manih hnoq biq nôôp ka khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt ji khơl thơy pato ganuun, yôôch oot hnoq rôp xadrah păk kaxêêt Kadraq ji pahnăp Kadraq ka tamooy kadrơy. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Oot hnoq đnooy ra ơơh Kadraq, khook kaxôh Kadraq, tiel dook Kadraq, ji păk kaxêêt Kadraq, bơh atêq pe hngơy Kadraq hnoq riirh hlê.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Ja-kơ ji Jăng, vaarq koot kanau ku Xê-bê-đê, truh tavơh Kadraq, đnooy dii Kadraq: “Kuh thơy, 'wot ưng trôôch đaneq long varơuq kajoq 'wot apôôy vôôch thơy, thơy hnoq dơơp ka 'wot.” <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yôôch Kadraq đnooy kung baarq: “Oh ay xung thơy dơơp kajoq ka oh ay?” <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Nưq laa baarq tơơl dii Kadraq: “Xiin bu xôq 'wot aleq ka 'wot hnoq ik 'ngôôy đom aduq tađnah tađnaak ku thơy, muuyq adro pi bơ thơy ji muuyq adro pi akeng thơy.” <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Bơh Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy ka baarq: “Oh ay be xet baarq đong vôôch varơuq kajoq. Oh ay hnoq ik hôôch dooy đơu thơy hôôch, long chiuq bap-tem đaji pheep bap-tem đơu thơy chiuq be?” <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Baarq tơơl dii Kadraq: “'Wot hnoq ik.” Yôôch Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii baarq: “Dooy đơu thơy hôôch, oh ay hnoq hôôch, ji pheep bap-tem đơu thơy chiuq, oh ay hnoq chiuq. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Bơh xôq 'ngôôy pi bơ long pi akeng ku thơy yôôych leh jo thơy ralauq xôq, bơh deng ka adro heq jah ralauq xôq 'miêh.” <verse eid="MRK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Tuôôy tameng varơuq neq, kưl dro jah rơơlh hơq tôq jaraq dii Ja-kơ ji Jăng. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Atêq tuôôy taayh oot truh, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Oh ay xet đaneq khơl adro jah vanê dưk xanok kaluh tamooy kadrơy yôôych rôp ahnen manih karôp, ji khơl adro e chưk varơuq ku oot yôôych xok dơơp qwuyen dơơp ahnen ahnek khơl kadrơy. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Bơh kaluh varơuq leh aalq laa đanưq đom katul oh ay. Wih hlê, adro leq xung vlôh jêêk kôt katul đom oh ay hnoq pheq laa adro hơu varơuq ku oh ay, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />ji adro leq xung laa akoq katul đom oh ay hnoq pheq laa xapok ka tôôy dro. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Vii Koot Manih pheq đnooy heq leh truh xôq jah hơu varơuq, bơh laa xôq hơu varơuq ji pahnăp xăk riirh kadraq dơơp jaq bla thay ka 'ngưng dro.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Oot hooy muut theng Jê-ri-kô, ji đom tuôôy Kadraq đong chuh hooy xing Jê-ri-kô kung khơl xatyauq kadraq ji bing manih karôp, yôôych Ba-ti-mê, koot kanau ku Ti-mê, laa muuyq adro vôôch xa apul đong 'ngôôy gah trôôk. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Tuôôy tameng xet đaneq nưq laa Lôôk Jê-xu manih Na-xa-ret, ay xarôp pariau kôt ji đnooy: “Ôi Jê-xu, Koot vuua Đa-vik, xiin biit angơuq gô!” <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />'Ngưng dro trek toah ay neq xôq ay hnhep, bơh ay pariau thier kôt iaq đnoyq: “Koot vuua Đa-vik, xiin biit angơuq gô!” <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Atêq tuôôy dưk tawaak, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Dayh taayh ay nưq.” Yôôch oot taayh dro apul nưq, dăt ay: “Dayh ieen xuum! Dưk tok yơu! Thơy đong taayh ay.” <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Yôôch tuôôy qwel aau kahliik ni hlê muuyq panưh, dưk tok, ay truh kung Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Tơơl hlê dii ay, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Ay trôôch gô dơơp kajoq ka ay?” Anưq laa adro apul tơơl kung Kadraq: “Ra-bi, nưq laa gô hnoq ik 'yo hloq.” <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Nưq laa Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii ay: “Dayh hooy. Xuum tuôq ku ay heq payơh ka ay.” Hloay juneq, ay 'yo hloq ik yôôch ay hooy tyauq Kadraq tol trôôk.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Tuôôy oot hooy jeq truh Jê-ru-sa-lem, truh Bê-pha-jê ji Bê-tha-ni, wih truh đoot Ô-liu, Kadraq patăk vaarq dro khơl xatyauq ku kadraq hooy, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />ji đnooy dii oot: “Dayh hooy muut palơy pla kangưưr oh ay, hloay tuôôy muut truh nưq, oh ay hnoq hloq muuyq lưưa koot biq vek, koq hmưq e kơyq acho tol ni. Dayh luh talơy vek ka ni ji jarooy ni xuq đnen. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Atoh kơyq nưq vôôch oh ay: ‘Aleq êêp ay dơơp anưq?’ yôôych dayh tơơl đaneq: ‘Lôôk e varơuq duh xung ni ji Kadraq hnoq atăq ăm ni hlê.’” <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Oot chuh hooy ji hloq muuyq lưưa koot biq vek ka 'mok gôk gah trôôk, lunưq oot luh talơy ka ni. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Toleq dro dưk đnư đnooy kung oot: “Baarq ay đong dơơp kajoq đơu luh talơy vek lưưa koot nưq?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Baarq tơơl hlê toleq adro nưq đaji Lôôk Jê-xu heq pato, ji khơl adro nưq xôq ka baarq hooy. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Oot jarooy lưưa koot xuq ka Lôôk Jê-xu yôôch hlơơk aau kahliik oot tol lưưa, ji Kadraq 'ngôôy tok nưq. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />'Ngưng dro hlơơk aau oot vlôh tol trôôk, măn dii sôôq kadrơy, yôôych hlơơk kaluh đook gay heq koh xing manay gôk. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Kaah khơl adro hooy adroyq hloay khơl adro tyauq atêq pariau kôt:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Hô-sa-na! Đangq ayuôôt laat Kơy kahri truh taayh yal Lôôk.<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Vanong hloay daak dêh hnoq truh ku mo kơy Đa-vik haay!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">Hô-sa-na đom aduq thier raa yơơt!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Kadraq heq hooy muut theng Jê-ru-sa-lem, muut đom hnhư hơu, ji tuôôy heq 'yo raa wiit tôôy thưq, vii wat nưq kung jeq klôôy yôôch, Kadraq hooy vlôh truh Bê-tha-ni kung kưl vaarq dro jah rơơlh. <verse eid="MRK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Hngơy atêq, tuôôy oot heq hooy vlôh klơlh Bê-tha-ni, yôôych Kadraq pangoot. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Tuôôy 'yo hloq muuyq ưk pok puut e 'ngưng hla xing kơn xangưưy, Kadraq truh, leh kheoq Kadraq hnoq axek hloq e play leq tol ưk be. Đơu tuôôy heq truh aduq ưk nưq, Kadraq be hloq e kajoq vơơ hla, vii koq aalq laa xiêk pok puut. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Xôq hlê varơuq neq, Kadraq xanoh dii ưk nưq: “Hnoq paq e đnoyq măn kơyq xa play xing aduq may đnoyq.” Khơl xatyauq Kadraq tameng apok nưq.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Tuôôy hooy truh Jê-ru-sa-lem, ji muut đom hnhư hơu, Kadraq xarôp đuôôy dro tek manih root đom hnhư hơu vlôh pi gôk, Kadraq vlơq kahlôôp para ku khơl adro tađôôy jêêt ji ragê ku khơl adro tek xêêp katrơu. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Kadraq leh ăm pheep paq kê kơyq xagook kaluh đôô gamưh hlê hnhư hơu. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Yôôch Kadraq pato oot ji đnooy: “Be aalq e apok valơk đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:17">‘Hnhư gô hnoq jah taayh laa hnhư xadrook apôôy ka tôôy tamooy’ ih?</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 11:17">Bơh khơl êêp heq dơơp ni jêêk kôôp tapu ku khơl varoh.”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt ji thơy pato ganuun tameng đanưq, yôôych oot axek trôôk đơu oot hnoq ik păk kaxêêt Kadraq, vii oot yôq Kadraq, bơyh dêq manih karôp raay tưng hưng truh varơuq pato dayq ku Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Truh tuôôy rayôôp klôôy, oot chuh klơlh theng.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Muut ka xaroq, đong tuôôy hooy dalơh hlê, oot hloq ưk pok puut heq kateh ha'yauq xing ưk rayah. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Atêq tuôôy văch hlê, Phi-e-rơ tơơl dii Kadraq: “Ra-bi, 'yo hơq! Ưk pok puut đơu thơy axaap heq kateh ha'yauq yôôch.” <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Tuôôy tơơl hlê, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Dayh e xuum tuôq aduq Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Dong dik, Thơy đnooy dii oh ay, đaneq adro leq đnooy dii ngok đoot neq: ‘Dayh vưyq tok ji qwel pôôt tahli,’ đơu leh biit ravơq đom xuum haay, bơh tuôq đaneq varơuq haay đnooy jeq xalih vlôh, yôôych varơuq hnoq jêêk ka adro nưq. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Vii anưq, thơy đnooy dii oh ay, dêq hloay tôôy varơuq oh ay xadrook apôôy ji ratuut vôôch, dayh tuôq đaneq oh ay heq nhonq jah, yôôych varơuq nưq hnoq jêêk ka oh ay. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Tuôôy oh ay dưk xadrook apôôy, atoh oh ay e varơuq tachơơl dii kơyq nưq, yôôych dayh tha ka'lăk, xôq Vaq ku oh ay laa Kơy măn tol plêêk kung tha ka'lăk oh ay truh kaluh lôp kadrôôp ku oh ay.” <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />(Bơh atoh oh ay leh tha ka'lăk, yôôych Vaq ku oh ay laa Kơy măn tol plêêk kung hnoq leh tha ka'lăk kaluh lôp kadrôôp ku oh ay.) <verse eid="MRK 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Yôôch oot laay hooy truh Jê-ru-sa-lem ji tuôôy Kadraq đong hooy đom hnhư hơu, khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt, khơl thơy pato ganuun, ji khơl kadraq lơơk truh kung Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Oot đnooy dii Kadraq: “Bơyh taay yaak leq đơu kơy dơơp kaluh varơuq nưq ji kơyq heq palo ăm kơy taay yaak neq xôq kơy hnoq ik dơơp kaluh varơuq nưq?” <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Bơh Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Gô kung hnoq vôôch êêp kơy muuyq apok, ji dayh tơơl apok gô, yôôch gô hnoq đnooy ka êêp kơy bơyh taay yaak leq đơu gô dơơp kaluh varơuq nưq. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Pheep bap-tem ku Jăng laa xing plêêk long xing koot manih? Dayh tơơl apok gô.” <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Oot tajauq dii mamuuyq đaneq: “Haay duh tơơl đaleq? Atoh haay đnooy: ‘Xing plêêk’, dro neq hnoq đnooy: ‘Atoh anưq, vii kơq kajoq đơu êêp kơy leh tuôq Jăng?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Wih hlê, atoh haay đnooy: ‘Xing koot manih,’ …?” (Bing oot yôq manih karôp, vii kơyq kơyq kung 'yo đaneq Jăng dong dik laa muuyq kơy hlit.) <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Lunưq tuôôy tơơl apok Lôôk Jê-xu, oot tơơl: “'Wot leh xet.” Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Gô kung leh đnooy dii êêp kơy xing taay yaak leq đơu gô dơơp kaluh varơuq nưq.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Kadraq xarôp đnooy dii oot bơơn apok atoh: “Muuyq adro hơq pêêt hluôôt nho, panưk paga rawiit, xiel raluk raniaq lok, xơy muuyq kadroak jư, ji ăm khơl adro pêêt nho xapo hlê hluôôt, yôôch vlôh hooy xangưưy. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Truh xiêk weelh, kơy patăk muuyq dro xapok truh dii khơl pêêt nho xôq xing khơl adro neq, kơy hnoq ik nhonq muuyq phon raak play ku hluôôt. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Đơu atêq tuôôy jư xok ay nưq, bing oot hmơt đnayh yôôch đuôôy xuq ti hloh. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Kơy laay patăk muuyq dro xapok kadrơy truh dii bing oot, ji dii adro nưq, oot tiel muut akoq ji đnooy ra ơơh. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Yôôch Kơy patăk xapok kadrơy đnoyq, dii adro nưq, bing oot păk kaxêêt, ji dii 'ngưng adro kadrơy — tuôôy hmơt dook adro neq, tuôôy păk kaxêêt adro hơq. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Kơy e muuyq dro tra, laa adro koot kanau thier xung, kơy patăk ay nưq, adro lôôch dik, truh dii bing oot, biit đaneq: ‘Bing oot hnoq 'yo yôq koot kanau kơy.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Bơh khơl pêêt nho nưq tajauq dii mamuuyq đaneq: ‘Neq laa adro dưk hlê. Hooy yơu, haay dayh păk kaxêêt ni, yôôch garuh anôôp dưk hlê hnoq laa ku haay.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Anưq laa atêq tuôôy rôp jư, bing oot păk kaxêêt adro koot nưq, yôôch avih ay vlôh pi gôk hluôôt nho. <verse eid="MRK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Lunưq, kôôch hluôôt nho hnoq dơơp kajoq? Kơy hnoq truh păk kaxêêt bing pêêt nho ji pahnăp hluôôt nho ka khơl adro kadrơy. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Khơl kơy koq đok apok neq đom Rahlăp Vah ih?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Kuk phơu đơu thơq xơy hnhư dơyh ka'lăk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">phơu nưq heq jah vlôh jêêk phơu muum hnhư.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Varơuq neq truh xing Lôôk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">ji nưq laa varơuq thier akêh đom mot haay.’”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Nưq laa oot axek trôôk rôp Kadraq đơu oot yôq manih karôp, vii oot hlolh đaneq Kadraq taboon apok atoh nưq nhămq muut oot. Lunưq tuôôy chuh klơlh Kadraq, oot ka'lăk hooy.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Yôôch oot patăk toleq dro bing thuôk adrơơk Pha-ri-si ji thuôk bing Hê-rôt truh kung Kadraq xôq bing oot dơơp đook Kadraq đom apok đnooy. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Tuôôy truh, oot đnooy dii Kadraq: “Kuh thơy, 'wot xet đaneq thơy laa manih dong dik ji aduq thơy, leh e varơuq tameng tyauq paq kê dro leq, vii thơy be 'yo muut pi gôk ku khơl kadrơy, tađôôy muut đnư, thơy pato dayq trôôk daak ku Kơy Plêêk jơq tyauq varơuq dik. E troq ganuun long leh tuôôy nôôp xơu ka Sê-sa? Haay duh nôôp long leh duh nôôp?” <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Bơh vii xet katâk xuum pa ôôh lar ku oot, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Aleq êêp kơy laay thưh gô? Dayh xagook ka gô muuyq đơ-ni-ê xôq gô 'yo.” <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Anưq laa oot xagook truh muuyq ravơu, yôôch Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Long lơuq ji yal dơuq neq laa ku kơyq?” Oot tơơl kung Kadraq: “Ku Sê-sa.” <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Tuôôy nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu patăk dăt oot: “Dayh bla ka Sê-sa kaluh kajoq ku Sê-sa, ji bla ka Kơy Plêêk kaluh kajoq ku Kơy Plêêk.” Oot raay tưng hưng adroyq Kadraq.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Yôôch bing manih Sa-đu-sê, laa khơl adro đnooy đaneq leh e varơuq riirh hlê, truh kung Kadraq ji vôôch 'yo Kadraq, đaneq: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Kuh thơy, Môi-se heq valơk ăm ka haay đaneq: ‘Atoh ay ku muuyq kơyq nưq kaxêêt hlơơp xôq hlê kadrê đơu koq e koot, yôôych ma oh ku adro ay pheq xok dro kadrê nưq ji pa jooy ka ay ni.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />E pơh oh ay nưq, adro ay ka xok kadrê yôôch kaxêêt, leh e koot, <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Adro thưq vaarq pajêêk ay nưq, yôôch kaxêêt, leh e koot, ji adro thưq pe kung anưq, <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Dêq pơh dro raay leh e koot. Atêq dêq hloay, adro mư kadrê kung kaxêêt. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Truh tuôôy riirh hlê, tuôôy oot riirh hlê, ay hơq hnoq laa kadrê ku kơyq đom sôôq oot? Vii pơh dro raay heq xok ay nưq dơơp kadrê.” <verse eid="MRK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Be aalq êêp kơy biq jarooy hooy hyaak hyul bơyh varơuq neq aleq, vii leh hlolh xet Rahlăp Vah kung đaji taay yaak ku Kơy Plêêk? <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Vii tuôôy khơl kadrơy xing aduq kaxêêt riirh hlê, khơl kadrơy leh pajêêk long ga, bơh oot hnoq dang đaji yaak plêêk tol plêêk. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Măn truh varơuq manih kaxêêt jah riirh hlê, be aleq êêp kơy koq đok đom rahlăp ku Môi-se, măn phon varơuq truh pôôp jaliê, luleq đơu Kơy Plêêk xanoh dii kơy đaneq: ‘Gô laa Kơy Plêêk ku Ap-ra-ham, Kơy Plêêk ku I-sak, ji Kơy Plêêk ku Ja-kôp’? <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Kadraq leh aalq laa Kơy Plêêk ku adro kaxêêt, đơu laa ku manih riirh. Êêp kơy đong hyaak hyul thier kôt.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Tuôôy muuyq đom khơl thơy pato ganuun heq truh jeq, tameng jah oot đong tagêh dii mamuuyq, hloq đaneq Kadraq tơơl apok khơl adro hơq thier haay, yôôych Kơy vôôch Kadraq: “Varơuq leq laa ganeen 'yo duh dik đom dêq hloay?” <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl đaneq: “Ganeen 'yo duh dik laa: ‘Nee I-sơ-ra-ên, dayh tameng ne, Lôôk, Kơy Plêêk ku haay, laa Lôôk vơ muuyq <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Koot pheq vado xiaq Lôôk laa Kơy Plêêk ku koot dii dêq hloay xuum klaak koot, dii dêq hloay phool hiel koot, dii dêq hloay xuum biit koot, ji dii dêq hloay paraat koot.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Ganeen thưq vaarq laa nee: ‘Koot pheq xung xiaq adro gah gih ku koot đaji xăk xamơk koot.’ Be e ganeen leq đêh kôt iaq vaarq ganeen neq.” <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Thơy pato ganuun đnooy dii Kadraq: “Jơq dik, kuh thơy! Thơy heq đnooy tyauq varơuq dik đaneq Kadraq laa vơ muuyq, ji be e Lôôk leq kadrơy đêh Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Vado xiaq Kadraq bơơn dêq xuum klaak, dii dêq hloay hlolh xet, kung dii dêq hloay paraat, ji xung xiaq manih gah gih đaji kadih xăk pheq đnooy e jaq iaq tôôy kuah lêh vuh ji kuah tơơk tưp.” <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Atêq tuôôy 'yo kơy, vii kơy heq tơơl hlê trôôk khôôt xet, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii kơy: “Kơy leh xangưưy klơlh daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk 'leq.” Ji leh kơyq măn hôôk vôôch 'yo Kadraq đnoyq.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Xôq tơơl hlê, tuôôy đong pato dayq đom chaal hnhư hơu, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Dơơp đaleq khơl thơy pato ganuun đnooy đaneq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh laa koot vuua Đa-vik? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Kadih vuua Đa-vik, đom Lôôk phool hiel, heq đnooy:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Lôôk xanoh dii Lôôk gô:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">“Dayh 'ngôôy pi bơ Gô,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">dong truh tuôôy leq Gô xôq khơl adro tachơơl koot 'laarq jôôk ku koot.”’<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Kadih vuua Đa-vik taayh Kadraq laa ‘Lôôk,’ yôôych dơơp aleq Kadraq laa koot ku vuua nưq ik?” Bing manih karôp xaam tameng Kadraq kach ahrơh trôôch.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Đom varơuq pato dayq ku kadraq, Kadraq đnooy: “Dayh văch 'yo dii khơl thơy pato ganuun, laa khơl adro ưng trôôch hooy dưk đom qwuân aau yơơt, kaluh apok vôôch hrok katul aduq tabôôt xa, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />aduq 'ngôôy tơơl dal đom hnhư tagumq kung kachô adroyq dik aduq đaamq pajêêk. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Khơl adro nưq luôôt hnhư ku mo valơu, dơơp bôô xadrook apôôy dong yơơt. Bing manih neq hnoq chiuq xưh xadrah găk khăk iaq.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yôôch tuôôy heq 'ngôôy pôôt ta hyioh aduq xôq trăp xôq jêêt tưp ku hnhư hơu, Kadraq 'yo manih karôp viet jêêt muut trăp đaji luleq. 'Ngưng adro karoh viet muut kasôôq 'ngưng jêêt. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Tuôôy muuyq mo valơu adrah tawaak truh, mo viet muut vaarq ravơu jêêt de, jaq triq muuyq chưng laa muuyq xu. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Atêq tuôôy taayh khơl xatyauq ku kadraq hlê, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Dong dik, thơy đnooy dii oh ay đaneq mo valơu adrah neq heq tưp 'ngưng iaq dêq hloay khơl adro heq viet jêêt muut trăp hơq. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Vii dêq hloay oot raay tưp xing varơuq raah e ku oot, bơh mo neq, xing đom varơuq adrah pơơl ku mo, heq tưp dêq padêq hloay mo e, 'ngưq laa tôôy thưq deng xôq văch riirh mo.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Tuôôy Kadraq đong chuh klơlh hnhư hơu, muuyq đom khơl xatyauq Kadraq tơơl dii Kadraq: “Thơy lơơy, 'yo hơ! Kaluh talaat phơu kôt xet toleq ji kaluh xơy panưk kaxay liep xet taleq!” <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy kung khơl xatyauq nưq: “Ay hloq kaluh hnhư kôt yơơt neq ih? Hnoq be măn e muuyq kuk phơu leq măn đnen ik xôq rahloot tol kuk phơu kadrơy đơu phơu nưq hnoq leh biq dơơp hrưp.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Ji tuôôy Kadraq đong 'ngôôy tol đoot Ô-liu ta hyioh hnhư hơu, Phi-e-rơ, Ja-kơ, Jăng ji Anh-rê vôôch đêh Kadraq: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Xiin thơy đnooy ka 'wot, tuôôy leq kaluh varơuq nưq hnoq xalih vlôh? Ji e dơuq hlêêl kajoq tuôôy tôôy varơuq nưq jeq ik jah jêêk?” <verse eid="MRK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Tuôôy nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu tok apok đnooy dii oot: “Dayh rơơt rol, te xôq kơyq jarooy pato oh ay hooy hyaak hyul. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />'Ngưng dro hnoq truh taayh yal thơy, đnooy đaneq: ‘Laa gô neq,’ ji oot hnoq jarooy 'ngưng adro hooy hyaak hyul. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Măn tuôôy oh ay tameng truh hmơt jăk ji hêêl đnooy truh hmơt jăk, yôôych te biit yôq; varơuq nưq pheq xalih vlôh, bơh koq aalq laa lôôch dik. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Vii tamooy neq hnoq dưk tok tachơơl hlê tamooy kadrơy, ji daak neq tachơơl hlê daak hơq. Hnoq e hrưng vari măn 'ngưng aduq, hnoq e 'ngưng naanq pangoot. Bơh varơuq nưq laa đơơu xarôp ku kaluh đơơt jiq pa iir.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Mot kadrơy, kadih oh ay pheq 'yo rơơt. Khơl kadrơy hnoq nôôp oh ay ka hnhư xadrah ji ka hnhư tagumq, oh ay hnoq biq tiel đnayh, hnoq dưk kangưưr khơl adro padrok ji khơl vuua vii kơq thơy, đaji muuyq apok xanưk ka oot. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Ji adroyq dik, Hêêl Kaxay pheq jah padoh taboon ka tôôy daak tamooy. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Tuôôy oot rôp jarooy oh ay hooy atăq nôôp, te biit truh apok haay pheq đnooy. Lunư, atoh apok leq jah kahniq ka oh ay đom wat nưq, yôôych dayh đnooy apok nưq; vii oh ay be aalq laa adro đong đnooy, bơh laa Kơy Phool Hiel. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Ay hnoq nôôp oh muut aduq kaxêêt, vaq yôôych nôôp koot. Yôôch koot xau hnoq dưk tok tachơơl hlê vaq miq ji khienq oot biq kaxêêt. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Oh ay hnoq biq tôôy dro tachơơl 'yarơ vii yal ku thơy. Bơh kơyq kajưk xuum dong truh lôôch dik, dro nưq hnoq jah wơơt.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Mot kadrơy, tuôôy oh ay hloq varơuq ramêq ku varơuq hruh hrek xalih vlôh aduq leh duh e (dro đok pheq hlolh), yôôych khơl leq măn aduq dêh Ju-đê dayh charơơk klôônq tok đoot, <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />măn kơyq măn tol apo hnhư, te pôôt kung te muut 'lăp xôq xok paq kê thưq kajoq vlôh klơlh hnhư xăk, <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />ji kơyq măn manay ruôngq, te wiit hlê xuq dii kaluh thưq măn pi atêq xôq xok aau kahliik ku xăk. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Bơh ra ơơh dik hloay ka khơl kadrê đong măn bonq ji khơl drê ăm koot uq đom kaluh hngơy nưq! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Wih hlê, dayh xadrook apôôy xôq varơuq nưq leh xalih vlôh muut xiêk ka oaq. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Vii đom kaluh hngơy nưq hnoq e pơơl dal truh mưk koq hmưq e đanưq jauq xing tuôôy xarôp panưk pajêêk, laa tuôôy Kơy Plêêk panưk jêêk tôôy paroh dong truh juneq, ji kung hnoq leh dong leq e hlê. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Ji atoh Lôôk leh hruut lêq kaluh hngơy nưq, tôôy xăk xamơk hnoq be jah wơơt. Bơh vii kơq khơl adro jah rơơlh, laa khơl adro Kadraq heq rơơlh, Kadraq goch palêq sôôq hngơy nưq. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Tuôôy nưq, atoh kơyq nưq đnooy dii oh ay: ‘'Yo nee, Lôôk Wơơt Dêh măn đnen! 'Yo Hơq, măn kơn hơq!’ yôôych te tuôq. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Vii lôôk wơơt dêh pa ôôh ji khơl hlit pa ôôh hnoq jah dưk tok, yôôch hnoq kahnoq vlôh kaluh dơuq akêh ji pheep akêh xôq, atoh hnoq ik, dơơp ăm hyaak hyul khơl adro jah rơơlh. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Bơh oh ay pheq 'yo rơơt! Dayh 'yo nee, thơy heq ăm oh ay xet adroyq tôôy varơuq yôôch.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Lunư, muut kaluh hngơy nưq, atêq đơơt pơơl dal nưq,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">mot hngơy hnoq biq kamơng jaluk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">xiêk hnoq leh paq xaraar tađnah aduq nưq;<verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />kaluh xalok hnoq xing plêêk klêh pôôt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:25">ji kaluh qwuyen da uh tol plêêk hnoq biq anhưh hrưng.<verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Tuôôy nưq, khơl kadrơy hnoq hloq Koot Manih dii taay yaak ji tađnah tađnaak kôt lơyq kahri truh katul kaluh đum kluk. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Atêq nưq, Kadraq hnoq patăk dăt khơl yaak plêêk ji Kadraq hnoq anguk hlê khơl adro jah rơơlh ku Kadraq loch poot panưh vari, xing lôôch vari dong truh lôôch plêêk.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Mot kadrơy, dayh hok xet apok atoh xing ưk pok puut. Tuôôy đook ni vlôh jêêk rangoch kaxeq ji vlôh hla yôôch, oh ay xet đaneq xiêk tôq heq jeq. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Kung đanưq, tuôôy oh ay hloq kaluh varơuq nưq xalih vlôh, oh ay xet đaneq Kadraq đong măn jeq, kangưưr 'mok. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Dong dik, thơy đnooy dii oh ay đaneq, adrơơk neq kajưk dik hnoq be hooy hlơơp dong truh tuôôy leq tôôy varơuq nưq xalih vlôh. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Plêêk ji vari hnoq hooy hlơơp, bơh kaluh apok ku thơy kajưk dik hnoq leh hooy hlơơp. <verse eid="MRK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Măn truh hngơy nưq long wat nưq, đêh vlôh Vaq, yôôych leh kơyq xet ik, pheq đnooy yaak plêêk tol plêêk kung leh, ji Koot kung anưq.<verse eid="MRK 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Dayh rơơt rol! Dayh văch parol ji apôôy, vii oh ay leh xet kawat nưq laa tuôôy leq. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Dang đaji muuyq dro hơq dưk hooy xangưưy hnhư, tuôôy heq hooy klơlh hnhư ni, ji heq pahnăp ka tôôy xapok ni qwuyen jư 'yo varơuq dơơp ku ni, yôôych kơy đnooy patăk adro jư 'mok đaneq dro nưq kơn duh parol 'yo; <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />jo nưq, dayh văch parol, vii oh ay leh xet tuôôy leq kôôch hnhư xuq truh — long muut rayôôp klôôy, long tuôôy katul mưng; long tuôôy ier rok long muut ka xaroq — <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />e đaneq atêq tuôôy tưng hưng xuq truh, kôôch rôp tavơh oh ay đong vik. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Bơh Varơuq đơu thơy đnooy dii oh ay, thơy kung đnooy dii tôôy adro: Dayh văch parol!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq vaarq hngơy tra laa lêh Dalơh Hlê ji lêh Tôôp Leh Tape, khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt kung thơy pato ganuun đong axek trôôk leq, xôq atêq tuôôy rôp jư Kadraq trôôk kadook padu, oot hnoq ik păk kaxêêt Kadraq dơyh. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Vii oot đnooy: “Leh duh dơơp đom tuôôy lêh, e đaneq paloanq hnoq xalih vlôh đom manih karôp.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Đong tuôôy Kadraq măn aduq Bê-tha-ni, đom hnhư ku Si-môn, adro tavơh bingq paruh, Kadraq đong 'ngôôy gah para xa yôôych muuyq khơl drê hooy truh, taway tyauq poop kave dơu bơơn ngok tađnưk dơu kam tung leh pha, thier mach jêêt. Atêq tuôôy pôh padah kave, mư uk dơu nưq tol akoq Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Bơh katul khơl oot, e muuyq sôôq dro tôq jaraq: “Vii kajoq đơu e varơuq tayuh alay jơu thơơm neq? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Vii jơu neq hnoq ik tek jah 'ngưng iaq pe hreek đơ-ni-ê yôôch ahlook ăm ka manih adrah.” Oot trek toah mư. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Bơh Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Dayh xôq mư nưq ieen. Aleq oh ay dơơp pơơl mư nưq? Mư heq dưk dơơp muuyq varơuq tolh ka thơy. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Vii oh ay hloay e manih adrah măn dii oh ay, ji paq kê tuôôy leq oh ay xung oh ay hnoq ik dơơp varơuq kaxay ka oot, bơh oh ay hnoq be e thơy hloay. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Mư heq dơơp varơuq đơu mư hnoq ik. Mư heq ralauq adroyq xôq para xaak thơy wih truh varơuq up xôq. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Dong dik, thơy đnooy dii oh ay, paq kê Hêêl Kaxay jah padoh pato aduq leq tol loch dêh araak yôôych varơuq đơu mư neq heq dơơp kung hnoq jah taboon hlê đom varơuq văch truh mư.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Măn Ju-đa Ich-ka-ri-ôt, muuyq đom kưl vaarq adro jah rơơlh, chuh hooy truh kung khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt xôq ni hnoq ik rôp nôôp Kadraq ka oot. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy tameng đanưq, oot thier hlah ji tavek ăm ni jêêt. Yôôch ni axek trôôk leq e kawah tolh xôq xalih xuum nôôp Kadraq.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Muut hngơy thưq nhưk ku lêh Tôôp Leh Tape, tuôôy khơl kadrơy tơơk tưp ôô trưưu koot lêh Dalơh Hlê, khơl xatyauq Kadraq đnooy dii Kadraq: “Thơy trôôch 'wot hooy 'meq ralauq măn aduq leq xôq Thơy hnoq ik xa lêh Dalơh Hlê?” <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Yôôch Kadraq patăk dăt vaarq đom khơl xatyauq kadraq, ji đnooy dii oot: “Dayh hooy muut đom theng, ji muuyq dro xagook wo daak hnoq tavơh oh ay. Dayh hooy tyauq ay nưq. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Atoh ay nưq muut hnhư leq, dayh đnooy dii kôôch hnhư đaneq: ‘Thơy đnooy: “Phong gưl ku gô, aduq gô hnoq ik xa lêh Dalơh Hlê dii khơl xatyauq gô, măn aduq leq?”’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Kôôch hnhư hnoq pato oh ay muuyq phong kôt tol paak heq jah ralauq xôq 'miêh yôôch, ji dayh doot deep ka haay aduq nưq.” <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Anưq laa khơl xatyauq chuh klơlh ji hooy muut theng, yôôch oot hloq tôôy varơuq dang đaji Kadraq heq đnooy dii oot, ji oot ralauq xôq waal xa lêh Dalơh Hlê.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Tuôôy heq truh rayôôp klôôy, Kadraq hooy truh kung dii kưl vaarq dro jah rơơlh. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Tuôôy oot đong 'ngôôy gah para xa ji xa kawaal, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Dong dik, Thơy đnooy dii oh ay đaneq muuyq dro đom oh ay, laa adro đong xa dii thơy, hnoq xalih xuum thơy.” <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Oot xarôp hlu rơu ji adro neq truh adro hơq tơơl dii Kadraq: “E lưp aalq laa gô be?” <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Bơh Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Nưq laa muuyq đom kưl vaarq oh ay, adro đong 'nharuuk tôôp muut dooy kung dii thơy. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Vii Koot Manih vlôh hooy dang đaji apok heq jah valơk truh Kadraq, bơh đangq axaap karoay thay ka dro đơu bơyh ni, Koot Manih biq xalih nôôp! Tolh iaq dro nưq te pa iir vlôh măn tolh iaq ka ni.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Đong tuôôy oot xa, atêq tuôôy xok tôôp, kuh kway, Kadraq pleelh vlôh, palo ka oot ji đnooy: “Dayh nhonq xok. Neq laa xăk xamơk ku thơy.” <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Ji atêq tuôôy xok dooy, kuh kway, Kadraq palo ka oot, ji oot raay hôôch aduq dooy nưq. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Neq laa vahaap tavek ku thơy, laa vahaap jah ahngok vlôh ka 'ngưng dro. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Dong dik, thơy đnooy dii oh ay, đaneq thơy kajưk dik paq măn hôôch daak xing play ku ưk nho đnoyq dong truh hngơy nưq, laa tuôôy thơy hôôch daak nho đơơu đom daak dêh Kơy Plêêk.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Atêq tuôôy kacheeu muuyq baai kacheeu vah, oot hooy vlôh wih truh đoot Ô-liu. <verse eid="MRK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot đaneq: “Dêq hloay oh ay hnoq xatôôlh gưlh, đaji e valơk đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">‘Gô hnoq dook manih xakaq,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">yôôych trưưu hnoq biq pachaay hyaak.’<verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Bơh atêq tuôôy thơy heq jah khienq ăm riirh hlê, thơy hnoq hooy adroyq oh ay truh Ga-li-lê.” <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Bơh Phi-e-rơ tơơl dii Kadraq: “Pheq đnooy long tôôy dro hnoq biq xatôôlh gưlh, bơh gô yôôych leh 'leq.” <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii kơy: “Dong dik, Thơy đnooy ka ay, đaneq hngơy neng — hloay klôôy neng — adroyq tuôôy ier pôô rok vaarq yưk, ay hnoq chôôyq thơy pe yưk.” <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Bơh kơy đnooy trôôk hôôk kajưk: “Atoh băt dăt gô kaxêêt kung dii thơy, gô kajưk dik hnoq leh chôôyq thơy.” Tuôôy nưq, dêq hloay oot kung raay đnooy đanưq.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Yôôch oot hooy truh muuyq aduq, anơng aduq nưq laa Gêt-sê-ma-nê, ji Kadraq đnooy dii khơl xatyauq kadraq: “Dayh 'ngôôy đnen đom tuôôy thơy apôôy.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Kadraq jarooy Phi-e-rơ, Ja-kơ ji Jăng kung hooy dii Kadraq, yôôch Kadraq xarôp hlu xuum ji thier raa xôôl dôôl. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Phool hiel ku thơy đong hlu rơu dik, truh mưk kaxêêt hlơơp. Dayh kưq măn đnen ji văch parol.” <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Yôôch hooy xangưưy athêêp muuyq kawah, Kadraq kul xăk pôôt vari ji xadrook apôôy đaneq, atoh e hnoq ik, xiin wat nưq dalơh klơlh Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Kadraq tơơl: “A-ba, Vaq lơơy, dii Vaq tôôy varơuq raay laa hnoq ik. Xiin taway dooy neq klơlh koot. Bơh be aalq laa varơuq koot trôôch, đơu laa varơuq Vaq trôôch.” <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Yôôch Kadraq wiit hlê ji hloq oot đong vik, lunưq Kadraq taayh Phi-e-rơ: “Si-môn, ay vik ih! Ay leh ik kah parol muuyq wat ik ih? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Dayh kah parol ji apôôy, xôq oh ay leh gưlh muut adô aluut. Xuum phool yôôych dik trôôch, bơh xăk xamơk laay ravoch.” <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Muuyq yưk tra, tuôôy heq hooy vlôh, Kadraq apôôy, tơơl kaluh apok dang anưq. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Ji yưk tra, tuôôy wiit hlê, Kadraq hloq oot đong vik, vii mot oot lakôôp paq ik, ji oot be xet kajoq xôq tơơl apok Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Yôôch Kadraq truh yưk thưq pe ji đnooy dii oot: “Oh ay măn đong vik ji padơy vado ih? Đu yôôch! Wat heq truh. Dayh 'yo yơu! Koot Manih jeq biq xalih nôôp muut ti adro e kadrôôp. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Dayh dưk tok, hooy yơu. 'Yo hơ, adro xalih thơy heq truh jeq.” <verse eid="MRK 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Hloay juneq, tuôôy Kadraq măn ja đong đnooy, Ju-đa, muuyq đom kưl vaarq dro jah rơơlh, tawaak truh ji kung dii ni laa muuyq bing manih karôp adrơk tyauq xieh maak ji gay gôk, hooy xing aduq khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt, khơl thơy pato ganuun ji khơl draq. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Tuôôy nưq, adro xalih xuum Kadraq heq ăm oot muuyq dơuq hlêêl, đaneq: “Adro leq đơu gô hiip yôôych jơq laa kơy nưq. Dayh rôp kơy nưq ji jarooy hooy trôôk rơơt rol.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Anưq laa, tuôôy heq truh aduq, hloay juneq, atêq tuôôy tawaak truh Kadraq, ni đnooy: “Ra-bi,” yôôch ni hiip Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Tuôôy nưq, bing oot tơơk ti tol Kadraq ji rôp jư Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Bơh muuyq dro hơq đom khơl adro dưk jeq, atêq tuôôy hruut xieh vlôh, heq kathôp dơơp xapok ku thơy dok dơơp kôt ji trơyq kloh tôôr ay nưq. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Tơơl hlê varơuq rôp jư, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Êêp kơy hooy vlôh kung dii xieh maak ji gay gôk xôq rôp gô đaji tachơơl hlê muuyq dro varoh ih? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Tôôy hngơy gô măn dii êêp kơy tuôôy pato dayq đom hnhư hơu, đơu êêp kơy leh rôp gô. Lunư, neq laa xôq apok Rahlăp Vah ik jah jêêk.” <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Atêq tuôôy ka'lăk hlê Kadraq, dêq hloay oot raay charơơk klôônq.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Muuyq tadăp blaay hơq hooy tyauq Kadraq, 'miêh vơ hlưp poop aau kahliik vaayh lanh klum rawiit xăk, ji oot rôp jư ay, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />bơh atêq tuôôy ka'lăk hlê poop aau kahliik, ay nưq lalôk ka'lăk xadăk.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Bing oot jarooy Lôôk Jê-xu truh aduq thơy dok dơơp kôt, ji dêq hloay khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt, khơl draq lơơk, kung khơl thơy pato ganuun raay tagumq anguk hlê. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Măn Phi-e-rơ tyauq Kadraq xing kơn xangưưy, muut truh pi'lăp đom chaal ku thơy dok dơơp kôt, yôôch Kơy 'ngôôy dii khơl kuun jư ji kajôôl xatôq pi gah ôôlh. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Tuôôy nưq, khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt ji dêq hloay Tayuup karôp Jo Thaiq đong axek xanưk tachơơl hlê Lôôk Jê-xu xôq jarooy Kadraq muut aduq kaxêêt, đơu oot be axek hloq kajoq. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Vii 'ngưng dro dơơp xanưk pa ôôh tachơơl hlê Kadraq, đơu apok xanưk ku oot yôôych leh klip dii mamuuyq. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Toleq dro, atêq tuôôy dưk tok, dơơp xanưk pa ôôh tachơơl hlê Kadraq, tuôôy đnooy <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />đaneq: “'Wot tameng kơy nưq đnooy laa ‘Gô hnoq pahyaak ka'lăk hnhư hơu jo ti manih dơơp vlôh neq, yôôch đom pe hngơy gô hnoq xơy muuyq hnhư hơu kadrơy leh aalq xing ti manih dơơp vlôh.’” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Long anưq, hloay kaah truh varơuq neq, yôôych apok xanưk ku oot kung leh muuyq kadroop. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Yôôch atêq tuôôy dưk tok măn katul tôôy adro, thơy dok dơơp kôt vôôch 'yo Lôôk Jê-xu đaneq: “Aleq ay leh tơơl apok kajoq dêq? Khơl adro neq dơơp xanưk tachơơl hlê ay varơuq kajoq?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Bơh Kadraq kưq hnhep ji leh tơơl apok kajoq dêq. Thơy dok dơơp kôt laay vôôch 'yo Kadraq, ji Kơy đnooy dii Kadraq: “Ay e jơq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, Koot ku Kơy đangq ayuôôt laat, be?” <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Tuôôy nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Jơq laa gô; yôôch khơl kơy hnoq hloq Koot Manih 'ngôôy pi bơ Kơy Taay Yaak ji truh katul kaluh đum kluk plêêk.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Nưq yôôch atêq tuôôy chieh hyaak aau ni, thơy tơơk tưp kôt đnooy: “Haay măn duh kajoq truh manih xanưk đnoyq? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Êêp kơy heq tameng apok katơơk galơh yôôch. Êêp kơy biit aleq?” Nưq yôôch dêq hloay raay atok xadrah Kadraq laa dro đangq kaxêêt. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Muuyq sôôq dro xarôp khaak kaxôh muut Kadraq, biik mot Kadraq ji tu tiel Kadraq, yôôch đnooy dii Kadraq: “Đnooy hlit 'yo yơu!” Toleq kuun jư kung kachup xok Kadraq đơu pađa.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Đom tuôôy Phi-e-rơ măn 'laarq chaal, muuyq đom khơl xapok kadrê ku thơy tơơk tưp kôt tawaak truh aduq kơy. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Tuôôy hloq Phi-e-rơ đong kajôôl xatôq, tuôôy 'yo anhinq kơy, mư nưq đnooy: “Ay kung măn dii Jê-xu, manih Na-xa-ret.” <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Bơh kơy chôôyq, đnooy đaneq: “Gô leh xet, kung be xet mư đong đnooy kajoq.” Yôôch kơy hooy vlôh pi gôk chaal. <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Adro xapok kadrê heq 'yo hloq kơy laay xarôp đnooy dii khơl adro đong dưk đnư đaneq: “Adro neq laa thuôk bing nưq!” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Bơh kơy chôôyq yưk tra. Muuyq jơy atêq nưq, khơl adro dưk đnư laay đnooy dii Phi-e-rơ: “Kajưk dik ay laa thuôk bing ja khơl adro nưq, vii ay kung laa manih Ga-li-lê.” <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Bơh kơy xarôp karoay ji paleek đaneq: “Gô be xet dro nưq, ka ado đơu êêp ay đong đnooy truh.” <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Nưq yôôych ier pôô rok yưk thưq vaarq ji Phi-e-rơ văch vlôh apok đơu Lôôk Jê-xu heq đnooy dii kơy đaneq: “Adroyq tuôôy ier pôô rok vaarq yưk, ay hnoq chôôyq thơy pe yưk,” lunưq đom ajơ rangơơp xuum, kơy vlôh nhim.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Hloay dêh xaroq meel, tuôôy khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt heq luh anguk tajauq dii khơl draq lơơk kung khơl thơy pato ganuun ji dêq hloay Tayuup karôp Jo Thaiq, yôôych atêq tuôôy vek Lôôk Jê-xu, oot jarooy Kadraq hooy ji pahnăp ka Phi-lat. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Phi-lat vôôch Kadraq: “Ay laa vuua tamooy Jo Thaiq jơq be?” Bơh tuôôy tơơl apok kơy, Kadraq đnooy: “Kadih kơy đnooy đanưq.” <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Yôôch khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt rôp kadrôôp Kadraq 'ngưng varơuq. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Tuôôy nưq, Phi-lat laay vôôch 'yo Kadraq, đaneq: “Ay leh tơơl hlê kajoq dêq ih? Dayh 'yo, oot đong rôp kadrôôp ay 'ngưng qwaq kachưng!” <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Bơh Lôôk Jê-xu leh eh tơơl hlê apok leq đnoyq, pheq dơơp Phi-lat xok dơơp akêh.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Mot kadrơy, muut tuôôy lêh, kơy 'ngưng luh vlôh ka manih karôp muuyq manih karuk đơu oot apôôy vôôch. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Tuôôy nưq, e muuyq dro jah taayh laa Ba-ra-ba đong biq karuk kung dii khơl adro dơơp paloanq, laa khơl adro lôp kadrôôp păk kaxêêt manih đom đơơt paloanq. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Atêq tuôôy garuk truh, manih karôp xarôp apôôy dăt kơy đaji kơy 'ngưng dơơp ka oot. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Tuôôy nưq, Phi-lat vôôch oot, đaneq: “Êêp trôôch gô luh vlôh Vuua tamooy Jo Thaiq ka êêp be?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Vii kơy nưq xet đaneq khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt heq rôp nôôp kadraq vii xuum 'yarơ. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Bơh khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt ahluk ahlul manih karôp xôq xaloah muut đnư, kơy nưq duh pheq luh vlôh Ba-ra-ba ka oot. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Lunư, tuôôy vôôch hlê, Phi-lat đnooy dii oot: “Nưq yôôych, gô duh dơơp kajoq dii adro đơu êêp taayh laa vuua tamooy Jo Thaiq neq?” <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Tuôôy nưq, manih karôp laay laa kôt: “Dayh đongq đing ni tol gay charăk.” <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Bơh, Phi-lat đnooy kung oot: “Vii varơuq xơk leq manih neq heq dơơp?” Lunư, khơl kadrơy kơn laa kôt iaq: “Dayh đongq đing ni tol gay charăk.” <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Tuôôy nưq, vii trôôch dơơp hlah xuum manih karôp, Phi-lat heq luh vlôh Ba-ra-ba ka oot ji kơy ăm jarooy Lôôk Jê-xu hooy xôq atêq tuôôy tiel dook, yôôych Kadraq biq đongq đing.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Tuôôy nưq, bing kuun ahwoa Kadraq muut đom hnhư (nưq laa hnhư padrok) ji taayh dêq bing kuun anguk hlê, <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />yôôch oot kahliik tol Kadraq muuyq poop aau maau tôô, yôôch ayil ka Kadraq muuyq poop đoat bơơn jaliê oot heq voot, <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />ji oot xarôp vôôch hrok Kadraq: “Laa tok Vuua manih Jo Thaiq!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Nưq yôôch, oot tiel tol akoq Kadraq bơơn gay ji khook kaxôh muut Kadraq, ji kul takuul pôôt akuh Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Tuôôy bing oot heq tache aklêêu Kadraq yôôch, oot leh ka'lăk klơlh Kadraq poop aau maau tôô ji pahlưp aau ku Kadraq muut ka Kadraq, yôôch jarooy Kadraq hooy xôq oot đongq đing Kadraq tol gay charăk. <verse eid="MRK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Oot rôp muuyq dro hooy tyauq trôôk nưq, anơng laa Si-môn, manih Si-ren (vaq ku A-lek-xan-đơ ji Ru-phu), xing katu tok, xôq kơy hlôôy gay charăk ku Kadraq.<verse eid="MRK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Oot jarooy Kadraq truh Gô-gô-tha (muuyq aduq đơu ni e iq laa “Aduq Kadah akoq”). <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Oot ăm Kadraq hôôch lok jah aluq dii jarơơu jươk, bơh Kadraq leh hôôch. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Yôôch oot đongq đing Kadraq ji ahlook rapa poop aau ku Kadraq bơơn kach palăk ka xăk, 'yo kơyq jah phon leq. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Tuôôy nưq laa wat thưq pe, oot đongq đing Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Neq laa kapah tapaat kadrôôp lôp ku Kadraq, heq jah valơk: “Vuua Manih Jo Thaiq.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Oot kung đongq đing vaarq dro atôk kung dii Kadraq, muuyq dro măn pi bơ, măn dro hơq măn pi akeng Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />(Apok Rahlăp Vah heq jah jêêk, đaneq: “Kadraq biq 'yo achung dii khơl adro lôp ganuun.”) <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Khơl dro hooy hlê đnooy ra ơơh Kadraq, 'ngongq 'ngengq akoq oot ji đnooy: “A ha! Adro pahrưp hnhư hơu yôôch panưk hlê đom pe hngơy, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />dayh kadih wơơt xăk bơơn trôôk pôôt klơlh gay charăk yơu!” <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Kung dang đanưq, Khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt dii khơl thơy pato ganuun, kung rapa tache xagiel Kadraq, oot đnooy: “Ni wơơt ik 'ngưng adro kadrơy, bơh ni leh ik kadih wơơt xok ni. <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, Vuua ku I-sơ-ra-ên, tuôôy neq dayh pôôt klơlh gay charăk yơu, xôq 'wot hloq đơu tuôq.” Khơl adro biq đongq đing kung dii Kadraq kung tache xagiel Kadraq.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Truh wat thưq drơu, varơuq kamơng jaluk vlôh katuh klum loch vari dong truh wat thưq xiit. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Muut wat thưq xiit, Lôôk Jê-xu taayh kôt apok: “Ê-lô-i, Ê-lô-i, la-ma sa-bach-tha-ni?” apok nưq e iq laa: “Kơy Plêêk gô lơơy, Kơy Plêêk gô lơơy, vii aleq Kadraq chuh ka'lăk gô?” <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Tuôôy tameng anưq, toleq dro dưk jeq đnư đnooy: “'Yo hơ, ni đong taayh Ê-li.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Nưq yôôch, muuyq kơyq nưq, atêq tuôôy charơơk hooy hnhuuk viik daak jămq muut buuy 'nhuuy, xa'măk tol gay kadeer, adro nưq ăm Kadraq hôôch, dăt: “Dayh kưq xôq kê ni, 'yo Ê-li e truh xagook ni pôôt be.” <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy heq taayh tok muuyq apok kôt, Lôôk Jê-xu khơơh hoot heet lôôch dik. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Ji vaayh maang đom hnhư hơu biq chieh dơơp vaarq xing ataalh pôôt 'laarq. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Tuôôy nưq padrok kuun, kơy dưk măn pi tahyioh Kadraq, tuôôy heq hloq đaneq Kadraq khơơh hoot heet lôôch dik đanưq, kơy đnooy: “Dong dik dro neq laa Koot ku Kơy Plêêk.” <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Kung e khơl adro khơl drê dưk 'yo xing kơn xangưưy, đom sôôq oot e Ma-ri Ma-đơ-len, Ma-ri (miq Ja-kơ de ji Jô-sê) kung dii Sa-lô-mê, <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />laa khơl adro đơu tuôôy Kadraq đong măn aduq Ga-li-lê, oot heq hooy tyauq Kadraq ji hơu varơuq Kadraq, măn 'ngưng khơl drê kadrơy đnoyq heq kung hooy tok dii Kadraq truh Jê-ru-sa-lem.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Tuôôy heq truh rayôôp klôôy yôôch, vii hngơy nưq laa Hngơy Ralauq Xôq, nưq laa hngơy adroyq hngơy Sa-bat, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Jô-sep laa manih xing dêh A-ri-ma-thê, muuyq dro dơơp đangq vado đom Tayuup Karôp, kung jơq laa adro đong takôô daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk, tuôôy heq truh aduq, kơy kalh xuum muut tavơh Phi-lat ji vôôch xaak Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Tuôôy nưq, Phi-lat thier akêh atoh dik laa Kadraq heq kaxêêt yôôch, ji atêq tuôôy taayh padrok xakaq kuun, kơy vôôch dro nưq 'yo thưh Kadraq heq kaxêêt dong leq. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Tuôôy heq xet hlolh dong varơuq xing padrok xakaq kuun, kơy nưq atăq xaak ka Jô-sep. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Atêq tuôôy root vaayh lanh, xagook Kadraq pôôt klơlh gay charăk, kơy ahnom Kadraq hlê bơơn vaayh nưq, ji xôq Kadraq muut muuyq aduq xanưng heq jah đuk đom troop phơu. Yôôch kơy palanh muuyq kuk phơu kôt klơl 'mok xanưng. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Tuôôy nưq, Ma-ri Ma-đơ-len ji Ma-ri miq ku Jô-sê heq dưk 'yo aduq Kadraq jah up xôq.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Tuôôy hngơy Sa-bat heq dêq, Ma-ri Ma-đơ-len, Ma-ri miq Ja-kơ, ji Sa-lô-mê, root jarơơu thơơm xôq tuôôy truh aduq, oot hnoq ik para xaak Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Xing thier meel hngơy thưq nhưk đom twuân, oot hooy truh aduq xanưng tuôôy mot hngơy vơ bloq tok. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Oot tajauq kung mamuuyq: “Kơyq hnoq vlơq kuk phơu klơlh 'mok xanưng ka haay?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Tuôôy 'yo tok, oot hloq đaneq kuk phơu heq jah palanh hooy, long ni thier kôt. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Yôôch tuôôy heq muut đom xanưng, oot hloq muuyq dro tadăp hlưp aau ko đong 'ngôôy măn pi bơ, ji oot biq kadrăch varaal. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Khơl adro nưq đnooy dii oot: “Te yôq. Êêp mư đong axek Jê-xu manih Na-xa-ret, Kơy heq biq đongq đing tol gay charăk. Kadraq heq jah khienq riirh hlê yôôch! Kadraq leh măn đnen. Dayh 'yo aduq đơu khơl kadrơy heq xôq xaak Kadraq. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Long anưq, dayh hooy, đnooy ka khơl xatyauq Kadraq ji Phi-e-rơ đaneq: ‘Kadraq hnoq hooy adroyq oh ay truh Ga-li-lê. Măn đnư, oh ay hnoq hloq Kadraq’, dang đaji Kadraq heq đnooy dii oh ay.”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Tuôôy heq vlôh pi gôk, oot charơơk klơlh xanưng, vii varơuq padrau padrik ji akêh klum xuum oot. Ji oot be đnooy kajoq dii kơyq bơyh vii oot thier yôq varaal. <verse eid="MRK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />(Xaroq meel hngơy thưq nhưk đom twuân, tuôôy heq riirh hlê, Kadraq rama vlôh adroyq dik ka Ma-ri Ma-đơ-len, laa adro đơu Kadraq heq druyh pơh kamuuych vlôh klơlh. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Adro khơl drê nưq hooy taboon hlê ka khơl adro hmưq măn dii Kadraq đom tuôôy oot đong hlu rơu ji nhim ook. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Măn oot, tuôôy tameng đaneq Kadraq đong măn riirh ji heq jah kadih mư 'yo hloq, yôôych leh tuôq.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq kaluh varơuq nưq, Kadraq rama vlôh đom long lơuq kadrơy ka vaarq dro đom sôôq oot đong tuôôy hooy jôôk hooy xuq dêh katu. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Ji vaarq dro nưq, atêq tuôôy wiit xuq hlê, taboon ka khơl xatyauq măn hlê, bơh oot leh tuôq baarq.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Bơh yôôch, lôôch dik, Kadraq rama vlôh ka kưl muuyq dro xatyauq đong tuôôy oot 'ngôôy gah para xa, Kadraq toah varơuq leh tuôq ji găk xuum ku oot vii oot be tuôq khơl adro heq hloq Kadraq atêq tuôôy Kadraq heq jah riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Kadraq đnooy patăk oot: “Tuôôy hooy truh loch dêh araak, dayh padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay ka tôôy dro. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Kơyq tuôq ji chiuq Bap-tem hnoq jah wơơt, măn kơyq leh tuôq hnoq biq rôp kadrôôp. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Kaluh hlêêl akêh neq hnoq xa tyauq dii khơl adro e xuum tuôq: Taayh yal thơy, oot hnoq druyh pađuôôy kaluh kamuuych. Oot hnoq đnooy kaluh apok athêêk đơơu. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Oot hnoq rôp volh, ji long ăm oot hôôch thưq kajoq đôk haiq, kajưk dik ni leh dơơp jiq jool kajoq truh oot. Oot hnoq xôq ti tol khơl adro jiq jiêh yôôych khơl adro nưq hnoq jah yơh.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Atêq tuôôy Lôôk Jê-xu heq đnooy dii oot, Kadraq jah taway tok plêêk ji 'ngôôy pi bơ Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Măn khơl adro nưq, atêq tuôôy vlôh hooy, oot padoh taboon loch tôôy aduq, đom tuôôy Lôôk dơơp varơuq kung dii oot ji 'yo xanưk ka đaauq bơơn kaluh dơuq akêh hooy xatyauq. Amen.)<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>